window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/a415-0b23e99eb10a7f2e.json"]={sha256:"0b23e99eb10a7f2e26134b433e91b46858cba47d515240a8b04d2b45d92cb2de",value:{"id":"a415","title":"偏振光學元件製作","titleEn":"Polarization-optics fabrication","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課以消光比與延遲量兩個核心指標貫穿偏振元件的製作：先用 Malus 定律與雙折射建立規格的物理意義，再分別處理石英波片的定向、研磨至延遲量與零級複合結構、方解石 Glan 稜鏡的全反射幾何、奈米線柵與 MacNeille 薄膜偏振分光器、Fresnel 菱體的消色差延遲，接著用 Sénarmont 與消光比量測建立誤差預算，最後處理應力雙折射安裝與規格交接。","summaryEn":"Two figures of merit, extinction ratio and retardance, run through this course on fabricating polarization optics: Malus's law and birefringence give the specifications physical meaning, then quartz-waveplate orientation, polishing to retardance and compound zero-order construction, the total-internal-reflection geometry of calcite Glan prisms, nanowire-grid and MacNeille thin-film beam splitters and the achromatic retardance of the Fresnel rhomb are treated in turn, followed by Sénarmont and extinction-ratio metrology for the error budget, stress-birefringence-free mounting and specification handoff.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-coatings-elements","subcategoryTitle":"薄膜、繞射與微結構光學元件","subcategoryTitleEn":"Coatings, diffractive and structured optical elements","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-coatings-elements","learningTags":["optics","optics-coatings-elements","coating"],"architectureFamily":"coating","architectureNodes":[["石英與方解石晶體定向切割","Quartz and calcite crystal orientation and cutting"],["研磨拋光至延遲量","Lapping and polishing to retardance"],["奈米線柵與 MacNeille 膜堆","Nanowire grid and MacNeille stack"],["增透膜與無應力安裝","Antireflection coating and stress-free mounting"],["Sénarmont 與消光比量測","Sénarmont and extinction-ratio metrology"],["規格驗收與交接","Specification acceptance and handoff"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,3],[2,3],[3,4],[4,1],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"coating","labels":["石英與方解石晶體定向切割","研磨拋光至延遲量","奈米線柵與 MacNeille 膜堆","增透膜與無應力安裝","Sénarmont 與消光比量測"],"labelsEn":["Quartz and calcite crystal orientation and cutting","Lapping and polishing to retardance","Nanowire grid and MacNeille stack","Antireflection coating and stress-free mounting","Sénarmont and extinction-ratio metrology"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"複合零級石英四分之一波片練習（633 nm）：Δn = 0.0091，零級厚度差 d = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm，以兩片約 700 µm 的石英片光軸交叉組合。延遲量公差 λ/300 對應厚度差公差 633/(300×0.0091) ≈ 0.23 µm；拋光速率 0.1 µm/min 時公差窗約 2 分鐘，必須以 Sénarmont 回授停機，Sénarmont 讀數 0.05° 給 λ/3600 的量測不確定度。使用條件：波長 ±0.5 nm → 零級敏感度 4×10⁻⁴ 波/nm → 2×10⁻⁴ 波；溫度 ±5 K → 2.4×10⁻⁵ 波/K → 1.2×10⁻⁴ 波；入射角 ±2° → 2.5×10⁻⁴ 相對 → 6×10⁻⁵ 波；安裝應力控制在 36 kPa 以下 → λ/1000 = 1×10⁻³ 波。總預算 RSS ≈ √(3.3² + 0.2² + 0.12² + 0.06² + 1²)×10⁻³ ≈ 3.5×10⁻³ 波 ≈ λ/290，符合 λ/250 的系統需求。若改用單片 10 級波片，光僅波長項就達 0.016 波/nm × 0.5 = 8×10⁻³ 波（λ/125），溫度項 5×10⁻³ 波，RSS ≈ λ/100，不合格。搭配的 Glan–Taylor 稜鏡消光比 10⁵:1，與 0.3° 的旋轉角控制合併後隔離度 ≈ 44 dB。數值皆為教學假設，不代表任何產品規格。","textEn":"Compound zero-order quartz quarter-wave plate exercise at 633 nm: Δn = 0.0091, zero-order thickness difference d = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm, built from two quartz plates of about 700 µm with crossed axes. A λ/300 retardance tolerance corresponds to a thickness-difference tolerance of 633/(300×0.0091) ≈ 0.23 µm; at a polish rate of 0.1 µm/min the tolerance window lasts about 2 minutes, so the stop is driven by Sénarmont feedback, whose 0.05° readout gives λ/3600 measurement uncertainty. Operating terms: wavelength ±0.5 nm with zero-order sensitivity 4×10⁻⁴ waves/nm → 2×10⁻⁴ waves; temperature ±5 K at 2.4×10⁻⁵ waves/K → 1.2×10⁻⁴ waves; incidence ±2° → 2.5×10⁻⁴ relative → 6×10⁻⁵ waves; mounting stress held below 36 kPa → λ/1000 = 1×10⁻³ waves. Total RSS ≈ √(3.3² + 0.2² + 0.12² + 0.06² + 1²)×10⁻³ ≈ 3.5×10⁻³ waves ≈ λ/290, meeting a λ/250 system requirement. A single 10th-order plate instead would have a wavelength term alone of 0.016 waves/nm × 0.5 = 8×10⁻³ waves (λ/125) and a temperature term of 5×10⁻³ waves, RSS ≈ λ/100, failing. The matching Glan–Taylor prism at 10⁵:1 combined with 0.3° rotation control gives isolation ≈ 44 dB. All values are teaching assumptions, not any product specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a415-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類」與「雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes\" and \"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a415-v12-01","title":"Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「交叉偏振片與消光比」如何決定偏振光學元件製作的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Crossed polarizers and extinction ratio” determines the key performance of “Polarization-optics fabrication”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"線偏振光通過透射軸夾角 θ 的理想偏振片後強度為 I = I₀cos²θ，這是 Malus 定律；真實偏振片以消光比 ER = T_max/T_min 描述，它由材料的二向吸收、晶體的全反射幾何或薄膜的 Brewster 條件決定。元件類別與消光比的典型範圍：拉伸聚合物片與含銀粒子玻璃 10³ 到 10⁴，鋁奈米線柵 10³ 到 10⁴ 且寬頻，薄膜分光立方體 10² 到 10³，方解石 Glan 稜鏡 10⁵ 到 10⁶。消光比規格必須連同波長、入射角與光束發散角一起給，因為這三者都會把漏光放大。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「交叉偏振片與消光比」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Linearly polarized light passing an ideal polarizer whose transmission axis is at angle θ emerges with I = I₀cos²θ, Malus's law; a real polarizer is described by its extinction ratio ER = T_max/T_min, set by dichroic absorption in the material, total-internal-reflection geometry in a crystal or the Brewster condition in a thin-film stack. Typical classes and ranges: stretched polymer sheet and silver-particle glass 10³ to 10⁴, aluminium nanowire grids 10³ to 10⁴ and broadband, thin-film cube splitters 10² to 10³, calcite Glan prisms 10⁵ to 10⁶. An extinction specification must always carry wavelength, incidence angle and beam divergence, because all three enlarge the leakage. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Crossed polarizers and extinction ratio”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：兩片交叉偏振片的對準誤差 Δθ 造成漏光 sin²Δθ：Δθ = 1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁴（等效消光比僅 3300:1），0.5° 時 7.6×10⁻⁵，0.1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁶，0.06° 時 1.1×10⁻⁶。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A misalignment Δθ between two crossed polarizers leaks sin²Δθ: 3.0×10⁻⁴ at Δθ = 1° (an effective extinction of only 3300:1), 7.6×10⁻⁵ at 0.5°, 3.0×10⁻⁶ at 0.1° and 1.1×10⁻⁶ at 0.06°.","failure":"常見誤解：「消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「交叉偏振片與消光比」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Crossed polarizers and extinction ratio”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-01-k1","title":"Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類","titleEn":"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes","text":"線偏振光通過透射軸夾角 θ 的理想偏振片後強度為 I = I₀cos²θ，這是 Malus 定律；真實偏振片以消光比 ER = T_max/T_min 描述，它由材料的二向吸收、晶體的全反射幾何或薄膜的 Brewster 條件決定。元件類別與消光比的典型範圍：拉伸聚合物片與含銀粒子玻璃 10³ 到 10⁴，鋁奈米線柵 10³ 到 10⁴ 且寬頻，薄膜分光立方體 10² 到 10³，方解石 Glan 稜鏡 10⁵ 到 10⁶。","textEn":"Linearly polarized light passing an ideal polarizer whose transmission axis is at angle θ emerges with I = I₀cos²θ, Malus's law; a real polarizer is described by its extinction ratio ER = T_max/T_min, set by dichroic absorption in the material, total-internal-reflection geometry in a crystal or the Brewster condition in a thin-film stack. Typical classes and ranges: stretched polymer sheet and silver-particle glass 10³ to 10⁴, aluminium nanowire grids 10³ to 10⁴ and broadband, thin-film cube splitters 10² to 10³, calcite Glan prisms 10⁵ to 10⁶.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes\" is correct?","options":["消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。","線偏振光通過透射軸夾角 θ 的理想偏振片後強度為 I = I₀cos²θ，這是 Malus 定律。","只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality.","Linearly polarized light passing an ideal polarizer whose transmission axis is at angle θ emerges with I = I₀cos²θ, Malus's law.","If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same."],"answer":1,"explanation":"線偏振光通過透射軸夾角 θ 的理想偏振片後強度為 I = I₀cos²θ，這是 Malus 定律；真實偏振片以消光比 ER = T_max/T_min 描述，它由材料的二向吸收、晶體的全反射幾何或薄膜的 Brewster 條件決定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Linearly polarized light passing an ideal polarizer whose transmission axis is at angle θ emerges with I = I₀cos²θ, Malus's law; a real polarizer is described by its extinction ratio ER = T_max/T_min, set by dichroic absorption in the material, total-internal-reflection geometry in a crystal or the Brewster condition in a thin-film stack. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a415-v12-02","title":"Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類：定量估算","titleEn":"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「交叉偏振片與消光比」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Crossed polarizers and extinction ratio” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：兩片交叉偏振片的對準誤差 Δθ 造成漏光 sin²Δθ：Δθ = 1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁴（等效消光比僅 3300:1），0.5° 時 7.6×10⁻⁵，0.1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁶，0.06° 時 1.1×10⁻⁶。所以要驗證 10⁶:1 的 Glan 稜鏡，兩個元件的相對軸向必須對準到 0.06° 以內，否則量到的是對準誤差而不是元件本身。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A misalignment Δθ between two crossed polarizers leaks sin²Δθ: 3.0×10⁻⁴ at Δθ = 1° (an effective extinction of only 3300:1), 7.6×10⁻⁵ at 0.5°, 3.0×10⁻⁶ at 0.1° and 1.1×10⁻⁶ at 0.06°. Verifying a 10⁶:1 Glan prism therefore requires the two axes aligned within 0.06°, or the measurement reports the alignment error rather than the component. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在準直的單頻雷射光束中放兩片待測偏振片，用精密旋轉台以 0.01° 步進掃過消光點，記錄透射功率對角度的曲線並擬合 cos² 加常數項，常數項即為真實漏光；量測時用光阱與擋板去除雜散光，並確認偵測器在六個數量級內線性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place the two polarizers in a collimated single-frequency laser beam, scan through extinction on a precision rotation stage in 0.01° steps, record transmitted power against angle and fit cos² plus a constant, the constant being the true leakage; use beam dumps and baffles to remove stray light and confirm detector linearity over six decades.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"兩片交叉偏振片的對準誤差 Δθ 造成漏光 sin²Δθ：Δθ = 1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁴（等效消光比僅 3300:1），0.5° 時 7.6×10⁻⁵，0.1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁶，0.06° 時 1.1×10⁻⁶。所以要驗證 10⁶:1 的 Glan 稜鏡，兩個元件的相對軸向必須對準到 0.06° 以內，否則量到的是對準誤差而不是元件本身。","textEn":"A misalignment Δθ between two crossed polarizers leaks sin²Δθ: 3.0×10⁻⁴ at Δθ = 1° (an effective extinction of only 3300:1), 7.6×10⁻⁵ at 0.5°, 3.0×10⁻⁶ at 0.1° and 1.1×10⁻⁶ at 0.06°. Verifying a 10⁶:1 Glan prism therefore requires the two axes aligned within 0.06°, or the measurement reports the alignment error rather than the component.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes\", which statement holds?","options":["任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。","波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。","兩片交叉偏振片的對準誤差 Δθ 造成漏光 sin²Δθ：Δθ = 1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁴（等效消光比僅 3300:1），0.5° 時 7.6×10⁻⁵，0.1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁶，0.06° 時 1.1×10⁻⁶。"],"optionsEn":["Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter.","A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions.","A misalignment Δθ between two crossed polarizers leaks sin²Δθ: 3.0×10⁻⁴ at Δθ = 1° (an effective extinction of only 3300:1), 7.6×10⁻⁵ at 0.5°, 3.0×10⁻⁶ at 0.1° and 1.1×10⁻⁶ at 0.06°."],"answer":2,"explanation":"兩片交叉偏振片的對準誤差 Δθ 造成漏光 sin²Δθ：Δθ = 1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁴（等效消光比僅 3300:1），0.5° 時 7.6×10⁻⁵，0.1° 時 3.0×10⁻⁶，0.06° 時 1.1×10⁻⁶。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A misalignment Δθ between two crossed polarizers leaks sin²Δθ: 3.0×10⁻⁴ at Δθ = 1° (an effective extinction of only 3300:1), 7.6×10⁻⁵ at 0.5°, 3.0×10⁻⁶ at 0.1° and 1.1×10⁻⁶ at 0.06°. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a415-v12-03","title":"Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「交叉偏振片與消光比」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Crossed polarizers and extinction ratio” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在準直的單頻雷射光束中放兩片待測偏振片，用精密旋轉台以 0.01° 步進掃過消光點，記錄透射功率對角度的曲線並擬合 cos² 加常數項，常數項即為真實漏光；量測時用光阱與擋板去除雜散光，並確認偵測器在六個數量級內線性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place the two polarizers in a collimated single-frequency laser beam, scan through extinction on a precision rotation stage in 0.01° steps, record transmitted power against angle and fit cos² plus a constant, the constant being the true leakage; use beam dumps and baffles to remove stray light and confirm detector linearity over six decades. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：用 2° 發散的 LED 光束量 Glan 稜鏡，部分光線超出全反射的接受角而直接漏過，消光比只讀到 10³:1，合格的稜鏡被判為不良；或偵測器在低功率端非線性，漏光被低估十倍。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Measuring a Glan prism with a 2° divergent LED beam lets rays beyond the total-internal-reflection acceptance angle leak straight through, reading only 10³:1 and rejecting a good prism; a detector non-linear at low power underestimates leakage tenfold.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在準直的單頻雷射光束中放兩片待測偏振片，用精密旋轉台以 0.01° 步進掃過消光點，記錄透射功率對角度的曲線並擬合 cos² 加常數項，常數項即為真實漏光；量測時用光阱與擋板去除雜散光，並確認偵測器在六個數量級內線性。","textEn":"Place the two polarizers in a collimated single-frequency laser beam, scan through extinction on a precision rotation stage in 0.01° steps, record transmitted power against angle and fit cos² plus a constant, the constant being the true leakage; use beam dumps and baffles to remove stray light and confirm detector linearity over six decades.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes\"?","options":["在準直的單頻雷射光束中放兩片待測偏振片，用精密旋轉台以 0.01° 步進掃過消光點，記錄透射功率對角度的曲線並擬合 cos² 加常數項，常數項即為真實漏光。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。"],"optionsEn":["Place the two polarizers in a collimated single-frequency laser beam, scan through extinction on a precision rotation stage in 0.01° steps, record transmitted power against angle and fit cos² plus a constant, the constant being the true leakage.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在準直的單頻雷射光束中放兩片待測偏振片，用精密旋轉台以 0.01° 步進掃過消光點，記錄透射功率對角度的曲線並擬合 cos² 加常數項，常數項即為真實漏光；量測時用光阱與擋板去除雜散光，並確認偵測器在六個數量級內線性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place the two polarizers in a collimated single-frequency laser beam, scan through extinction on a precision rotation stage in 0.01° steps, record transmitted power against angle and fit cos² plus a constant, the constant being the true leakage; use beam dumps and baffles to remove stray light and confirm detector linearity over six decades. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a415-v12-04","title":"Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類：失效診斷","titleEn":"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「交叉偏振片與消光比」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Crossed polarizers and extinction ratio” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"用 2° 發散的 LED 光束量 Glan 稜鏡，部分光線超出全反射的接受角而直接漏過，消光比只讀到 10³:1，合格的稜鏡被判為不良；或偵測器在低功率端非線性，漏光被低估十倍。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Measuring a Glan prism with a 2° divergent LED beam lets rays beyond the total-internal-reflection acceptance angle leak straight through, reading only 10³:1 and rejecting a good prism; a detector non-linear at low power underestimates leakage tenfold. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：消光比規格必須連同波長、入射角與光束發散角一起給，因為這三者都會把漏光放大。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: An extinction specification must always carry wavelength, incidence angle and beam divergence, because all three enlarge the leakage.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用 2° 發散的 LED 光束量 Glan 稜鏡，部分光線超出全反射的接受角而直接漏過，消光比只讀到 10³:1，合格的稜鏡被判為不良；或偵測器在低功率端非線性，漏光被低估十倍。","textEn":"Measuring a Glan prism with a 2° divergent LED beam lets rays beyond the total-internal-reflection acceptance angle leak straight through, reading only 10³:1 and rejecting a good prism; a detector non-linear at low power underestimates leakage tenfold.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「Malus 定律、消光比與偏振元件分類」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Malus's law, extinction ratio and polarizer classes\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","用 2° 發散的 LED 光束量 Glan 稜鏡，部分光線超出全反射的接受角而直接漏過，消光比只讀到 10³:1，合格的稜鏡被判為不良。","只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Measuring a Glan prism with a 2° divergent LED beam lets rays beyond the total-internal-reflection acceptance angle leak straight through, reading only 10³:1 and rejecting a good prism.","If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用 2° 發散的 LED 光束量 Glan 稜鏡，部分光線超出全反射的接受角而直接漏過，消光比只讀到 10³:1，合格的稜鏡被判為不良；或偵測器在低功率端非線性，漏光被低估十倍。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Measuring a Glan prism with a 2° divergent LED beam lets rays beyond the total-internal-reflection acceptance angle leak straight through, reading only 10³:1 and rejecting a good prism; a detector non-linear at low power underestimates leakage tenfold. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a415-v12-05","title":"雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「石英波片的雙折射與延遲量」如何決定偏振光學元件製作的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Birefringence and retardance of a quartz waveplate” determines the key performance of “Polarization-optics fabrication”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"單軸晶體對平行與垂直光軸的偏振有不同折射率，厚度 d 的平板使兩個分量產生相位差 Γ = Δn·d/λ（以波數計），這就是延遲量。石英在 633 nm 的 Δn 約 0.0091，真正的零級四分之一波片只有十幾微米厚，無法獨立研磨，所以有兩種做法：多級波片把延遲量做成 m + 1/4 波（厚度數百微米），或把兩片多級片光軸交叉疊合，使厚度差等於零級厚度，稱為複合零級波片。多級波片的延遲量對波長與溫度的敏感度隨級數線性放大，這是工程選擇的核心。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「石英波片的雙折射與延遲量」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A uniaxial crystal has different indices for polarizations parallel and perpendicular to its optic axis, so a plate of thickness d gives the two components a phase difference Γ = Δn·d/λ in waves, the retardance. Quartz has Δn of about 0.0091 at 633 nm, so a true zero-order quarter-wave plate is only tens of micrometres thick and cannot be polished free-standing; either a multi-order plate carries m + 1/4 waves at several hundred micrometres, or two multi-order plates are stacked with crossed axes so their thickness difference equals the zero-order thickness, the compound zero-order plate. A multi-order plate's sensitivity of retardance to wavelength and temperature scales with its order, which is the core of the engineering choice. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Birefringence and retardance of a quartz waveplate”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：零級四分之一波片 d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm；10 級（10.25 波）d ≈ 713 µm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A zero-order quarter-wave plate has d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm; a 10th-order plate (10.25 waves) d ≈ 713 µm.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「石英波片的雙折射與延遲量」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Birefringence and retardance of a quartz waveplate”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-05-k1","title":"雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片","titleEn":"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates","text":"單軸晶體對平行與垂直光軸的偏振有不同折射率，厚度 d 的平板使兩個分量產生相位差 Γ = Δn·d/λ（以波數計），這就是延遲量。石英在 633 nm 的 Δn 約 0.0091，真正的零級四分之一波片只有十幾微米厚，無法獨立研磨，所以有兩種做法：多級波片把延遲量做成 m + 1/4 波（厚度數百微米），或把兩片多級片光軸交叉疊合，使厚度差等於零級厚度，稱為複合零級波片。","textEn":"A uniaxial crystal has different indices for polarizations parallel and perpendicular to its optic axis, so a plate of thickness d gives the two components a phase difference Γ = Δn·d/λ in waves, the retardance. Quartz has Δn of about 0.0091 at 633 nm, so a true zero-order quarter-wave plate is only tens of micrometres thick and cannot be polished free-standing; either a multi-order plate carries m + 1/4 waves at several hundred micrometres, or two multi-order plates are stacked with crossed axes so their thickness difference equals the zero-order thickness, the compound zero-order plate.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates\" is correct?","options":["只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。","波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。","單軸晶體對平行與垂直光軸的偏振有不同折射率，厚度 d 的平板使兩個分量產生相位差 Γ = Δn·d/λ（以波數計），這就是延遲量。"],"optionsEn":["If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same.","A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter.","A uniaxial crystal has different indices for polarizations parallel and perpendicular to its optic axis, so a plate of thickness d gives the two components a phase difference Γ = Δn·d/λ in waves, the retardance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"單軸晶體對平行與垂直光軸的偏振有不同折射率，厚度 d 的平板使兩個分量產生相位差 Γ = Δn·d/λ（以波數計），這就是延遲量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A uniaxial crystal has different indices for polarizations parallel and perpendicular to its optic axis, so a plate of thickness d gives the two components a phase difference Γ = Δn·d/λ in waves, the retardance. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a415-v12-06","title":"雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片：定量估算","titleEn":"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「石英波片的雙折射與延遲量」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Birefringence and retardance of a quartz waveplate” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：零級四分之一波片 d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm；10 級（10.25 波）d ≈ 713 µm。λ/300 的延遲量公差對應厚度公差 Δd = λ/(300Δn) ≈ 0.23 µm，零級與多級相同。波長敏感度 ∂Γ/∂λ ≈ −Γ/λ：零級每 nm 僅 4×10⁻⁴ 波（λ/2500），10 級則 0.016 波（λ/62）。溫度（取 dΔn/dT ≈ −1×10⁻⁶/K、α ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁵/K 為教學假設）：零級約 −2.4×10⁻⁵ 波/K，10 級約 −1.0×10⁻³ 波/K，10 K 溫差就吃掉 λ/100。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A zero-order quarter-wave plate has d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm; a 10th-order plate (10.25 waves) d ≈ 713 µm. A λ/300 retardance tolerance corresponds to a thickness tolerance Δd = λ/(300Δn) ≈ 0.23 µm, the same for zero- and multi-order. Wavelength sensitivity ∂Γ/∂λ ≈ −Γ/λ: only 4×10⁻⁴ waves per nm (λ/2500) for zero order but 0.016 waves (λ/62) for 10th order. Temperature (taking dΔn/dT ≈ −1×10⁻⁶/K and α ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁵/K as teaching assumptions): about −2.4×10⁻⁵ waves/K for zero order and −1.0×10⁻³ waves/K for 10th order, so a 10 K change consumes λ/100. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用可調波長光源或幾條雷射線量同一片波片的延遲量，畫出延遲量對波長的斜率，由斜率反推級數並與設計核對；把波片放在溫控座上以 10 K 步進升溫量延遲量漂移，與溫度係數估計比較，確認複合零級波片的兩片厚度匹配。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the same plate's retardance at a tunable source or several laser lines, plot retardance against wavelength, infer the order from the slope and check it against the design; heat the plate on a temperature-controlled mount in 10 K steps and measure the drift, comparing with the temperature-coefficient estimate to confirm that the two halves of a compound zero-order plate are thickness-matched.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"零級四分之一波片 d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm；10 級（10.25 波）d ≈ 713 µm。λ/300 的延遲量公差對應厚度公差 Δd = λ/(300Δn) ≈ 0.23 µm，零級與多級相同。波長敏感度 ∂Γ/∂λ ≈ −Γ/λ：零級每 nm 僅 4×10⁻⁴ 波（λ/2500），10 級則 0.016 波（λ/62）。溫度（取 dΔn/dT ≈ −1×10⁻⁶/K、α ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁵/K 為教學假設）：零級約 −2.4×10⁻⁵ 波/K，10 級約 −1.0×10⁻³ 波/K，10 K 溫差就吃掉 λ/100。","textEn":"A zero-order quarter-wave plate has d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm; a 10th-order plate (10.25 waves) d ≈ 713 µm. A λ/300 retardance tolerance corresponds to a thickness tolerance Δd = λ/(300Δn) ≈ 0.23 µm, the same for zero- and multi-order. Wavelength sensitivity ∂Γ/∂λ ≈ −Γ/λ: only 4×10⁻⁴ waves per nm (λ/2500) for zero order but 0.016 waves (λ/62) for 10th order. Temperature (taking dΔn/dT ≈ −1×10⁻⁶/K and α ≈ 1.4×10⁻⁵/K as teaching assumptions): about −2.4×10⁻⁵ waves/K for zero order and −1.0×10⁻³ waves/K for 10th order, so a 10 K change consumes λ/100.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates\", which statement holds?","options":["零級四分之一波片 d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm；10 級（10.25 波）d ≈ 713 µm。","延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。","玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。"],"optionsEn":["A zero-order quarter-wave plate has d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm; a 10th-order plate (10.25 waves) d ≈ 713 µm.","A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate.","Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"零級四分之一波片 d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm；10 級（10.25 波）d ≈ 713 µm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A zero-order quarter-wave plate has d = λ/(4Δn) = 633/(4×0.0091) ≈ 17.4 µm; a 10th-order plate (10.25 waves) d ≈ 713 µm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a415-v12-07","title":"雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「石英波片的雙折射與延遲量」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Birefringence and retardance of a quartz waveplate” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用可調波長光源或幾條雷射線量同一片波片的延遲量，畫出延遲量對波長的斜率，由斜率反推級數並與設計核對；把波片放在溫控座上以 10 K 步進升溫量延遲量漂移，與溫度係數估計比較，確認複合零級波片的兩片厚度匹配。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the same plate's retardance at a tunable source or several laser lines, plot retardance against wavelength, infer the order from the slope and check it against the design; heat the plate on a temperature-controlled mount in 10 K steps and measure the drift, comparing with the temperature-coefficient estimate to confirm that the two halves of a compound zero-order plate are thickness-matched. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了省成本在二極體雷射系統用 10 級波片，雷射波長隨溫度漂移 2 nm 使延遲量偏 λ/30，偏振態變成橢圓，下游 Faraday 隔離器的隔離度掉 10 dB；複合零級波片兩片光軸未精確交叉，殘留的多級特性讓溫度敏感度回到多級等級。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Using a 10th-order plate in a diode-laser system to save cost lets a 2 nm wavelength drift with temperature shift retardance by λ/30, the polarization turns elliptical and the downstream Faraday isolator loses 10 dB; a compound zero-order plate whose two axes are not precisely crossed retains multi-order behaviour and its temperature sensitivity returns to the multi-order level.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用可調波長光源或幾條雷射線量同一片波片的延遲量，畫出延遲量對波長的斜率，由斜率反推級數並與設計核對；把波片放在溫控座上以 10 K 步進升溫量延遲量漂移，與溫度係數估計比較，確認複合零級波片的兩片厚度匹配。","textEn":"Measure the same plate's retardance at a tunable source or several laser lines, plot retardance against wavelength, infer the order from the slope and check it against the design; heat the plate on a temperature-controlled mount in 10 K steps and measure the drift, comparing with the temperature-coefficient estimate to confirm that the two halves of a compound zero-order plate are thickness-matched.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","用可調波長光源或幾條雷射線量同一片波片的延遲量，畫出延遲量對波長的斜率，由斜率反推級數並與設計核對。","偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure the same plate's retardance at a tunable source or several laser lines, plot retardance against wavelength, infer the order from the slope and check it against the design.","A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用可調波長光源或幾條雷射線量同一片波片的延遲量，畫出延遲量對波長的斜率，由斜率反推級數並與設計核對；把波片放在溫控座上以 10 K 步進升溫量延遲量漂移，與溫度係數估計比較，確認複合零級波片的兩片厚度匹配。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the same plate's retardance at a tunable source or several laser lines, plot retardance against wavelength, infer the order from the slope and check it against the design; heat the plate on a temperature-controlled mount in 10 K steps and measure the drift, comparing with the temperature-coefficient estimate to confirm that the two halves of a compound zero-order plate are thickness-matched. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a415-v12-08","title":"雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片：失效診斷","titleEn":"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「石英波片的雙折射與延遲量」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Birefringence and retardance of a quartz waveplate” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了省成本在二極體雷射系統用 10 級波片，雷射波長隨溫度漂移 2 nm 使延遲量偏 λ/30，偏振態變成橢圓，下游 Faraday 隔離器的隔離度掉 10 dB；複合零級波片兩片光軸未精確交叉，殘留的多級特性讓溫度敏感度回到多級等級。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Using a 10th-order plate in a diode-laser system to save cost lets a 2 nm wavelength drift with temperature shift retardance by λ/30, the polarization turns elliptical and the downstream Faraday isolator loses 10 dB; a compound zero-order plate whose two axes are not precisely crossed retains multi-order behaviour and its temperature sensitivity returns to the multi-order level. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：多級波片的延遲量對波長與溫度的敏感度隨級數線性放大，這是工程選擇的核心。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A multi-order plate's sensitivity of retardance to wavelength and temperature scales with its order, which is the core of the engineering choice.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了省成本在二極體雷射系統用 10 級波片，雷射波長隨溫度漂移 2 nm 使延遲量偏 λ/30，偏振態變成橢圓，下游 Faraday 隔離器的隔離度掉 10 dB；複合零級波片兩片光軸未精確交叉，殘留的多級特性讓溫度敏感度回到多級等級。","textEn":"Using a 10th-order plate in a diode-laser system to save cost lets a 2 nm wavelength drift with temperature shift retardance by λ/30, the polarization turns elliptical and the downstream Faraday isolator loses 10 dB; a compound zero-order plate whose two axes are not precisely crossed retains multi-order behaviour and its temperature sensitivity returns to the multi-order level.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「雙折射、延遲量與零級／多級波片」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Birefringence, retardance and zero-order versus multi-order plates\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。","為了省成本在二極體雷射系統用 10 級波片，雷射波長隨溫度漂移 2 nm 使延遲量偏 λ/30，偏振態變成橢圓，下游 Faraday 隔離器的隔離度掉 10 dB。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter.","Using a 10th-order plate in a diode-laser system to save cost lets a 2 nm wavelength drift with temperature shift retardance by λ/30, the polarization turns elliptical and the downstream Faraday isolator loses 10 dB."],"answer":2,"explanation":"為了省成本在二極體雷射系統用 10 級波片，雷射波長隨溫度漂移 2 nm 使延遲量偏 λ/30，偏振態變成橢圓，下游 Faraday 隔離器的隔離度掉 10 dB；複合零級波片兩片光軸未精確交叉，殘留的多級特性讓溫度敏感度回到多級等級。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using a 10th-order plate in a diode-laser system to save cost lets a 2 nm wavelength drift with temperature shift retardance by λ/30, the polarization turns elliptical and the downstream Faraday isolator loses 10 dB; a compound zero-order plate whose two axes are not precisely crossed retains multi-order behaviour and its temperature sensitivity returns to the multi-order level. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a415-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡」與「線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms\" and \"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a415-v12-09","title":"晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「晶體定向、研磨至延遲量與方解石稜鏡」如何決定偏振光學元件製作的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Crystal orientation, polishing to retardance and calcite prisms” determines the key performance of “Polarization-optics fabrication”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"石英波片的晶片必須切成光軸平行於表面，定向用 X 光繞射或錐光干涉圖確認到 0.1° 以內，再研磨拋光到厚度；因為延遲量對厚度的要求是 0.2 µm 等級，最後一道工序不是量厚度而是邊拋邊量延遲量，直到進入公差。複合零級波片的兩片以光學膠合或空氣間隙組合，膠合會引入應力與雷射功率限制。方解石 Glan–Taylor 稜鏡由兩塊光軸平行於入射面的方解石以空氣間隙組成，切角使尋常光在間隙全反射、非常光穿透；接受角由兩個臨界角夾出，只有幾度，材料的解理與軟度使加工與清潔都比玻璃困難。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「晶體定向、研磨至延遲量與方解石稜鏡」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A quartz waveplate blank is cut with the optic axis parallel to the surface, the orientation verified to within 0.1° by X-ray diffraction or conoscopic interference, then lapped and polished to thickness; because the retardance demands thickness at the 0.2 µm level, the final step measures retardance while polishing rather than thickness, stopping inside tolerance. The two halves of a compound zero-order plate are optically cemented or air-spaced, cementing bringing stress and a laser-power limit. A calcite Glan–Taylor prism is two calcite pieces with optic axes parallel to the entrance face separated by an air gap, cut so the ordinary ray is totally reflected at the gap while the extraordinary ray passes; the acceptance angle lies between two critical angles and is only a few degrees, and calcite's cleavage and softness make machining and cleaning harder than glass. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Crystal orientation, polishing to retardance and calcite prisms”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：方解石（589 nm）n_o = 1.658、n_e = 1.486：空氣間隙的臨界角分別為 arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° 與 arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°，間隙面切角取約 39.7° 使尋常光全反射而非常光穿透，內部角度餘裕約 ±2.6°，折算到空氣中約 ±4° 的接受角。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For calcite at 589 nm, n_o = 1.658 and n_e = 1.486: the air-gap critical angles are arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° and arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°, so the gap is cut near 39.7° to totally reflect the ordinary ray and pass the extraordinary one, leaving an internal margin of about ±2.6°, roughly ±4° of acceptance in air.","failure":"常見誤解：「波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「晶體定向、研磨至延遲量與方解石稜鏡」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Crystal orientation, polishing to retardance and calcite prisms”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-09-k1","title":"晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡","titleEn":"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms","text":"石英波片的晶片必須切成光軸平行於表面，定向用 X 光繞射或錐光干涉圖確認到 0.1° 以內，再研磨拋光到厚度；因為延遲量對厚度的要求是 0.2 µm 等級，最後一道工序不是量厚度而是邊拋邊量延遲量，直到進入公差。複合零級波片的兩片以光學膠合或空氣間隙組合，膠合會引入應力與雷射功率限制。","textEn":"A quartz waveplate blank is cut with the optic axis parallel to the surface, the orientation verified to within 0.1° by X-ray diffraction or conoscopic interference, then lapped and polished to thickness; because the retardance demands thickness at the 0.2 µm level, the final step measures retardance while polishing rather than thickness, stopping inside tolerance. The two halves of a compound zero-order plate are optically cemented or air-spaced, cementing bringing stress and a laser-power limit.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms\" is correct?","options":["石英波片的晶片必須切成光軸平行於表面，定向用 X 光繞射或錐光干涉圖確認到 0.1° 以內，再研磨拋光到厚度。","波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。","任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。"],"optionsEn":["A quartz waveplate blank is cut with the optic axis parallel to the surface, the orientation verified to within 0.1° by X-ray diffraction or conoscopic interference, then lapped and polished to thickness.","A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter.","Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"石英波片的晶片必須切成光軸平行於表面，定向用 X 光繞射或錐光干涉圖確認到 0.1° 以內，再研磨拋光到厚度；因為延遲量對厚度的要求是 0.2 µm 等級，最後一道工序不是量厚度而是邊拋邊量延遲量，直到進入公差。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A quartz waveplate blank is cut with the optic axis parallel to the surface, the orientation verified to within 0.1° by X-ray diffraction or conoscopic interference, then lapped and polished to thickness; because the retardance demands thickness at the 0.2 µm level, the final step measures retardance while polishing rather than thickness, stopping inside tolerance. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a415-v12-10","title":"晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡：定量估算","titleEn":"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「晶體定向、研磨至延遲量與方解石稜鏡」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Crystal orientation, polishing to retardance and calcite prisms” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：方解石（589 nm）n_o = 1.658、n_e = 1.486：空氣間隙的臨界角分別為 arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° 與 arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°，間隙面切角取約 39.7° 使尋常光全反射而非常光穿透，內部角度餘裕約 ±2.6°，折算到空氣中約 ±4° 的接受角。研磨至延遲量：拋光速率 0.1 µm/min 時，最後 0.23 µm 的公差窗只有約 2 分鐘，必須以延遲量回授停機。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For calcite at 589 nm, n_o = 1.658 and n_e = 1.486: the air-gap critical angles are arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° and arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°, so the gap is cut near 39.7° to totally reflect the ordinary ray and pass the extraordinary one, leaving an internal margin of about ±2.6°, roughly ±4° of acceptance in air. Polishing to retardance: at a polish rate of 0.1 µm/min the final 0.23 µm tolerance window lasts only about 2 minutes, so the stop must be driven by retardance feedback. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：每片晶片拋光前以錐光干涉圖檢查光軸方向，拋光中每隔數分鐘取下用 Sénarmont 法量延遲量並記錄厚度減少量，驗證線性關係；Glan 稜鏡組裝後以旋轉台掃描入射角，量消光比隨角度的變化，確認接受角與臨界角計算一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check each blank's optic-axis direction by conoscopic interference before polishing; during polishing remove the plate every few minutes, measure retardance by the Sénarmont method and log thickness removed to verify linearity; after assembling a Glan prism, scan incidence angle on a rotation stage and measure extinction against angle to confirm the acceptance window matches the critical-angle calculation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"方解石（589 nm）n_o = 1.658、n_e = 1.486：空氣間隙的臨界角分別為 arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° 與 arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°，間隙面切角取約 39.7° 使尋常光全反射而非常光穿透，內部角度餘裕約 ±2.6°，折算到空氣中約 ±4° 的接受角。研磨至延遲量：拋光速率 0.1 µm/min 時，最後 0.23 µm 的公差窗只有約 2 分鐘，必須以延遲量回授停機。","textEn":"For calcite at 589 nm, n_o = 1.658 and n_e = 1.486: the air-gap critical angles are arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° and arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°, so the gap is cut near 39.7° to totally reflect the ordinary ray and pass the extraordinary one, leaving an internal margin of about ±2.6°, roughly ±4° of acceptance in air. Polishing to retardance: at a polish rate of 0.1 µm/min the final 0.23 µm tolerance window lasts only about 2 minutes, so the stop must be driven by retardance feedback.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms\", which statement holds?","options":["波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。","方解石（589 nm）n_o = 1.658、n_e = 1.486：空氣間隙的臨界角分別為 arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° 與 arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°，間隙面切角取約 39.7° 使尋常光全反射而非常光穿透，內部角度餘裕約 ±2.6°，折算到空氣中約 ±4° 的接受角。","偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。"],"optionsEn":["A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions.","For calcite at 589 nm, n_o = 1.658 and n_e = 1.486: the air-gap critical angles are arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° and arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°, so the gap is cut near 39.7° to totally reflect the ordinary ray and pass the extraordinary one, leaving an internal margin of about ±2.6°, roughly ±4° of acceptance in air.","A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"方解石（589 nm）n_o = 1.658、n_e = 1.486：空氣間隙的臨界角分別為 arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° 與 arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°，間隙面切角取約 39.7° 使尋常光全反射而非常光穿透，內部角度餘裕約 ±2.6°，折算到空氣中約 ±4° 的接受角。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For calcite at 589 nm, n_o = 1.658 and n_e = 1.486: the air-gap critical angles are arcsin(1/1.658) ≈ 37.1° and arcsin(1/1.486) ≈ 42.3°, so the gap is cut near 39.7° to totally reflect the ordinary ray and pass the extraordinary one, leaving an internal margin of about ±2.6°, roughly ±4° of acceptance in air. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a415-v12-11","title":"晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「晶體定向、研磨至延遲量與方解石稜鏡」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Crystal orientation, polishing to retardance and calcite prisms” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"每片晶片拋光前以錐光干涉圖檢查光軸方向，拋光中每隔數分鐘取下用 Sénarmont 法量延遲量並記錄厚度減少量，驗證線性關係；Glan 稜鏡組裝後以旋轉台掃描入射角，量消光比隨角度的變化，確認接受角與臨界角計算一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check each blank's optic-axis direction by conoscopic interference before polishing; during polishing remove the plate every few minutes, measure retardance by the Sénarmont method and log thickness removed to verify linearity; after assembling a Glan prism, scan incidence angle on a rotation stage and measure extinction against angle to confirm the acceptance window matches the critical-angle calculation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：晶片光軸偏離表面 2°，延遲量隨入射角產生不對稱變化且在正向就偏離設計；方解石稜鏡清潔時溶劑滲入空氣間隙殘留薄膜，全反射條件被破壞，消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10².","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A blank whose optic axis is 2° out of the surface gives asymmetric retardance against incidence angle and is off design even at normal incidence; solvent wicking into the air gap of a calcite prism during cleaning leaves a film that breaks total internal reflection and drops extinction from 10⁵ to 10².","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每片晶片拋光前以錐光干涉圖檢查光軸方向，拋光中每隔數分鐘取下用 Sénarmont 法量延遲量並記錄厚度減少量，驗證線性關係；Glan 稜鏡組裝後以旋轉台掃描入射角，量消光比隨角度的變化，確認接受角與臨界角計算一致。","textEn":"Check each blank's optic-axis direction by conoscopic interference before polishing; during polishing remove the plate every few minutes, measure retardance by the Sénarmont method and log thickness removed to verify linearity; after assembling a Glan prism, scan incidence angle on a rotation stage and measure extinction against angle to confirm the acceptance window matches the critical-angle calculation.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。","每片晶片拋光前以錐光干涉圖檢查光軸方向，拋光中每隔數分鐘取下用 Sénarmont 法量延遲量並記錄厚度減少量，驗證線性關係。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality.","Check each blank's optic-axis direction by conoscopic interference before polishing."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每片晶片拋光前以錐光干涉圖檢查光軸方向，拋光中每隔數分鐘取下用 Sénarmont 法量延遲量並記錄厚度減少量，驗證線性關係；Glan 稜鏡組裝後以旋轉台掃描入射角，量消光比隨角度的變化，確認接受角與臨界角計算一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check each blank's optic-axis direction by conoscopic interference before polishing; during polishing remove the plate every few minutes, measure retardance by the Sénarmont method and log thickness removed to verify linearity; after assembling a Glan prism, scan incidence angle on a rotation stage and measure extinction against angle to confirm the acceptance window matches the critical-angle calculation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a415-v12-12","title":"晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡：失效診斷","titleEn":"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「晶體定向、研磨至延遲量與方解石稜鏡」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Crystal orientation, polishing to retardance and calcite prisms” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"晶片光軸偏離表面 2°，延遲量隨入射角產生不對稱變化且在正向就偏離設計；方解石稜鏡清潔時溶劑滲入空氣間隙殘留薄膜，全反射條件被破壞，消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10². 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A blank whose optic axis is 2° out of the surface gives asymmetric retardance against incidence angle and is off design even at normal incidence; solvent wicking into the air gap of a calcite prism during cleaning leaves a film that breaks total internal reflection and drops extinction from 10⁵ to 10². Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：方解石 Glan–Taylor 稜鏡由兩塊光軸平行於入射面的方解石以空氣間隙組成，切角使尋常光在間隙全反射、非常光穿透；接受角由兩個臨界角夾出，只有幾度，材料的解理與軟度使加工與清潔都比玻璃困難。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A calcite Glan–Taylor prism is two calcite pieces with optic axes parallel to the entrance face separated by an air gap, cut so the ordinary ray is totally reflected at the gap while the extraordinary ray passes; the acceptance angle lies between two critical angles and is only a few degrees, and calcite's cleavage and softness make machining and cleaning harder than glass.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"晶片光軸偏離表面 2°，延遲量隨入射角產生不對稱變化且在正向就偏離設計；方解石稜鏡清潔時溶劑滲入空氣間隙殘留薄膜，全反射條件被破壞，消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10².","textEn":"A blank whose optic axis is 2° out of the surface gives asymmetric retardance against incidence angle and is off design even at normal incidence; solvent wicking into the air gap of a calcite prism during cleaning leaves a film that breaks total internal reflection and drops extinction from 10⁵ to 10².","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「晶體偏振元件的加工：波片與 Glan 稜鏡」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Fabricating crystal polarization optics: waveplates and Glan prisms\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["晶片光軸偏離表面 2°，延遲量隨入射角產生不對稱變化且在正向就偏離設計。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。"],"optionsEn":["A blank whose optic axis is 2° out of the surface gives asymmetric retardance against incidence angle and is off design even at normal incidence.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter."],"answer":0,"explanation":"晶片光軸偏離表面 2°，延遲量隨入射角產生不對稱變化且在正向就偏離設計；方解石稜鏡清潔時溶劑滲入空氣間隙殘留薄膜，全反射條件被破壞，消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10². 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A blank whose optic axis is 2° out of the surface gives asymmetric retardance against incidence angle and is off design even at normal incidence; solvent wicking into the air gap of a calcite prism during cleaning leaves a film that breaks total internal reflection and drops extinction from 10⁵ to 10². Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a415-v12-13","title":"線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「鋁奈米線柵、MacNeille 膜堆與 Fresnel 菱體」如何決定偏振光學元件製作的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Aluminium nanowire grid, MacNeille stack and Fresnel rhomb” determines the key performance of “Polarization-optics fabrication”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"鋁奈米線柵以奈米壓印或干涉微影在玻璃上做出週期 100 到 150 nm、占空比約一半的鋁線，當週期遠小於波長時，電場平行線條的偏振被反射、垂直的被透射，寬頻且耐高溫，但週期必須小於波長除以基板折射率才不會產生繞射級。MacNeille 偏振分光立方體靠多層膜內每個界面都在 Brewster 角工作：p 偏振幾乎不反射而 s 偏振被四分之一波堆高反射，條件 n_g² = 2n_H²n_L²/(n_H² + n_L²) 把膜材與立方體玻璃綁在一起。Fresnel 菱體用兩次全反射各產生約 45° 的相位差，延遲量只依賴折射率，幾乎不隨波長變化，是消色差的四分之一波延遲器。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「鋁奈米線柵、MacNeille 膜堆與 Fresnel 菱體」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"An aluminium nanowire grid is made by nanoimprint or interference lithography as 100 to 150 nm pitch lines of about half duty cycle on glass; for pitch far below the wavelength the polarization parallel to the wires is reflected and the perpendicular one transmitted, broadband and heat-tolerant, but the pitch must stay below the wavelength divided by the substrate index to avoid diffracted orders. A MacNeille polarizing cube works with every interface of its multilayer at Brewster's angle: p polarization is barely reflected while s is strongly reflected by the quarter-wave stack, and the condition n_g² = 2n_H²n_L²/(n_H² + n_L²) ties the film materials to the cube glass. A Fresnel rhomb produces about 45° of phase difference at each of two total internal reflections; the retardance depends only on refractive index and hardly on wavelength, giving an achromatic quarter-wave retarder. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Aluminium nanowire grid, MacNeille stack and Fresnel rhomb”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：線柵：週期 120 nm、基板 n = 1.5 時，繞射級在 λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm 才出現，整個可見光安全。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Wire grid: with 120 nm pitch and substrate n = 1.5, diffracted orders appear only for λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm, so the whole visible band is safe.","failure":"常見誤解：「任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「鋁奈米線柵、MacNeille 膜堆與 Fresnel 菱體」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Aluminium nanowire grid, MacNeille stack and Fresnel rhomb”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-13-k1","title":"線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器","titleEn":"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders","text":"鋁奈米線柵以奈米壓印或干涉微影在玻璃上做出週期 100 到 150 nm、占空比約一半的鋁線，當週期遠小於波長時，電場平行線條的偏振被反射、垂直的被透射，寬頻且耐高溫，但週期必須小於波長除以基板折射率才不會產生繞射級。MacNeille 偏振分光立方體靠多層膜內每個界面都在 Brewster 角工作：p 偏振幾乎不反射而 s 偏振被四分之一波堆高反射，條件 n_g² = 2n_H²n_L²/(n_H² + n_L²) 把膜材與立方體玻璃綁在一起。","textEn":"An aluminium nanowire grid is made by nanoimprint or interference lithography as 100 to 150 nm pitch lines of about half duty cycle on glass; for pitch far below the wavelength the polarization parallel to the wires is reflected and the perpendicular one transmitted, broadband and heat-tolerant, but the pitch must stay below the wavelength divided by the substrate index to avoid diffracted orders. A MacNeille polarizing cube works with every interface of its multilayer at Brewster's angle: p polarization is barely reflected while s is strongly reflected by the quarter-wave stack, and the condition n_g² = 2n_H²n_L²/(n_H² + n_L²) ties the film materials to the cube glass.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders\" is correct?","options":["任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。","鋁奈米線柵以奈米壓印或干涉微影在玻璃上做出週期 100 到 150 nm、占空比約一半的鋁線，當週期遠小於波長時，電場平行線條的偏振被反射、垂直的被透射，寬頻且耐高溫，但週期必須小於波長除以基板折射率才不會產生繞射級。","延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。"],"optionsEn":["Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter.","An aluminium nanowire grid is made by nanoimprint or interference lithography as 100 to 150 nm pitch lines of about half duty cycle on glass.","A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate."],"answer":1,"explanation":"鋁奈米線柵以奈米壓印或干涉微影在玻璃上做出週期 100 到 150 nm、占空比約一半的鋁線，當週期遠小於波長時，電場平行線條的偏振被反射、垂直的被透射，寬頻且耐高溫，但週期必須小於波長除以基板折射率才不會產生繞射級。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"An aluminium nanowire grid is made by nanoimprint or interference lithography as 100 to 150 nm pitch lines of about half duty cycle on glass; for pitch far below the wavelength the polarization parallel to the wires is reflected and the perpendicular one transmitted, broadband and heat-tolerant, but the pitch must stay below the wavelength divided by the substrate index to avoid diffracted orders. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a415-v12-14","title":"線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器：定量估算","titleEn":"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鋁奈米線柵、MacNeille 膜堆與 Fresnel 菱體」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Aluminium nanowire grid, MacNeille stack and Fresnel rhomb” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：線柵：週期 120 nm、基板 n = 1.5 時，繞射級在 λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm 才出現，整個可見光安全。MacNeille：TiO₂/SiO₂（2.35/1.46）需 n_g = √(2×5.52×2.13/(5.52 + 2.13)) ≈ 1.75 的重火石玻璃；Al₂O₃/MgF₂（1.63/1.38）則 n_g ≈ 1.49，可用 BK7。Fresnel 菱體（BK7，54.6°）：每次全反射的延遲 δ = 2·arctan[cosθ·√(sin²θ − 1/n²)/sin²θ]，633 nm（n = 1.5151）為 45.3°，兩次 90.6°；400 nm（n = 1.5308）為 92.1°，1064 nm（n = 1.5066）為 89.7°，全波段偏離 90° 僅 −0.3° 到 +2.1°（最大約 λ/170）。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Wire grid: with 120 nm pitch and substrate n = 1.5, diffracted orders appear only for λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm, so the whole visible band is safe. MacNeille: TiO₂/SiO₂ (2.35/1.46) needs n_g = √(2×5.52×2.13/(5.52 + 2.13)) ≈ 1.75, a dense flint glass, whereas Al₂O₃/MgF₂ (1.63/1.38) gives n_g ≈ 1.49 and works with BK7. Fresnel rhomb (BK7, 54.6°): each total internal reflection retards by δ = 2·arctan[cosθ·√(sin²θ − 1/n²)/sin²θ], 45.3° at 633 nm (n = 1.5151) and 90.6° for two; 92.1° at 400 nm (n = 1.5308) and 89.7° at 1064 nm (n = 1.5066), a departure from 90° of only −0.3° to +2.1° (at most about λ/170) across the band. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以掃描電子顯微鏡量線柵的週期、線寬與高度，用分光光度計加偏振片量 TM 穿透與 TE 反射光譜，確認短波端沒有繞射引起的穿透率突降；對 MacNeille 立方體以 s、p 偏振分別量穿透與反射對入射角的曲線，核對 Brewster 條件的角度寬度；對菱體以多波長 Sénarmont 量延遲量，驗證消色差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure wire-grid pitch, line width and height by scanning electron microscopy and record TM transmission and TE reflection spectra with a spectrophotometer and polarizer, confirming no diffraction-induced transmission drop at the short-wavelength end; for a MacNeille cube measure s and p transmission and reflection against incidence angle to check the angular width of the Brewster condition; measure the rhomb's retardance at several wavelengths by the Sénarmont method to verify achromaticity.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"線柵：週期 120 nm、基板 n = 1.5 時，繞射級在 λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm 才出現，整個可見光安全。MacNeille：TiO₂/SiO₂（2.35/1.46）需 n_g = √(2×5.52×2.13/(5.52 + 2.13)) ≈ 1.75 的重火石玻璃；Al₂O₃/MgF₂（1.63/1.38）則 n_g ≈ 1.49，可用 BK7。Fresnel 菱體（BK7，54.6°）：每次全反射的延遲 δ = 2·arctan[cosθ·√(sin²θ − 1/n²)/sin²θ]，633 nm（n = 1.5151）為 45.3°，兩次 90.6°；400 nm（n = 1.5308）為 92.1°，1064 nm（n = 1.5066）為 89.7°，全波段偏離 90° 僅 −0.3° 到 +2.1°（最大約 λ/170）。","textEn":"Wire grid: with 120 nm pitch and substrate n = 1.5, diffracted orders appear only for λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm, so the whole visible band is safe. MacNeille: TiO₂/SiO₂ (2.35/1.46) needs n_g = √(2×5.52×2.13/(5.52 + 2.13)) ≈ 1.75, a dense flint glass, whereas Al₂O₃/MgF₂ (1.63/1.38) gives n_g ≈ 1.49 and works with BK7. Fresnel rhomb (BK7, 54.6°): each total internal reflection retards by δ = 2·arctan[cosθ·√(sin²θ − 1/n²)/sin²θ], 45.3° at 633 nm (n = 1.5151) and 90.6° for two; 92.1° at 400 nm (n = 1.5308) and 89.7° at 1064 nm (n = 1.5066), a departure from 90° of only −0.3° to +2.1° (at most about λ/170) across the band.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders\", which statement holds?","options":["玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。","消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。","線柵：週期 120 nm、基板 n = 1.5 時，繞射級在 λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm 才出現，整個可見光安全。"],"optionsEn":["Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence.","Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality.","Wire grid: with 120 nm pitch and substrate n = 1.5, diffracted orders appear only for λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm, so the whole visible band is safe."],"answer":2,"explanation":"線柵：週期 120 nm、基板 n = 1.5 時，繞射級在 λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm 才出現，整個可見光安全。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Wire grid: with 120 nm pitch and substrate n = 1.5, diffracted orders appear only for λ \u003c 1.5×120 = 180 nm, so the whole visible band is safe. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a415-v12-15","title":"線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「鋁奈米線柵、MacNeille 膜堆與 Fresnel 菱體」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Aluminium nanowire grid, MacNeille stack and Fresnel rhomb” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以掃描電子顯微鏡量線柵的週期、線寬與高度，用分光光度計加偏振片量 TM 穿透與 TE 反射光譜，確認短波端沒有繞射引起的穿透率突降；對 MacNeille 立方體以 s、p 偏振分別量穿透與反射對入射角的曲線，核對 Brewster 條件的角度寬度；對菱體以多波長 Sénarmont 量延遲量，驗證消色差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure wire-grid pitch, line width and height by scanning electron microscopy and record TM transmission and TE reflection spectra with a spectrophotometer and polarizer, confirming no diffraction-induced transmission drop at the short-wavelength end; for a MacNeille cube measure s and p transmission and reflection against incidence angle to check the angular width of the Brewster condition; measure the rhomb's retardance at several wavelengths by the Sénarmont method to verify achromaticity. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：把為 BK7 設計的 MacNeille 膜堆鍍在 n = 1.75 的玻璃上，Brewster 條件不再成立，p 偏振在每個界面都有反射，消光比從 10³ 掉到 30；線柵週期做到 200 nm，藍光端出現繞射級，穿透率在 450 nm 以下崩落。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A MacNeille stack designed for BK7 deposited on n = 1.75 glass no longer meets the Brewster condition, p polarization reflects at every interface and extinction falls from 10³ to 30; a wire grid made at 200 nm pitch diffracts at the blue end and transmission collapses below 450 nm.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以掃描電子顯微鏡量線柵的週期、線寬與高度，用分光光度計加偏振片量 TM 穿透與 TE 反射光譜，確認短波端沒有繞射引起的穿透率突降；對 MacNeille 立方體以 s、p 偏振分別量穿透與反射對入射角的曲線，核對 Brewster 條件的角度寬度；對菱體以多波長 Sénarmont 量延遲量，驗證消色差。","textEn":"Measure wire-grid pitch, line width and height by scanning electron microscopy and record TM transmission and TE reflection spectra with a spectrophotometer and polarizer, confirming no diffraction-induced transmission drop at the short-wavelength end; for a MacNeille cube measure s and p transmission and reflection against incidence angle to check the angular width of the Brewster condition; measure the rhomb's retardance at several wavelengths by the Sénarmont method to verify achromaticity.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders\"?","options":["以掃描電子顯微鏡量線柵的週期、線寬與高度，用分光光度計加偏振片量 TM 穿透與 TE 反射光譜，確認短波端沒有繞射引起的穿透率突降。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Measure wire-grid pitch, line width and height by scanning electron microscopy and record TM transmission and TE reflection spectra with a spectrophotometer and polarizer, confirming no diffraction-induced transmission drop at the short-wavelength end.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以掃描電子顯微鏡量線柵的週期、線寬與高度，用分光光度計加偏振片量 TM 穿透與 TE 反射光譜，確認短波端沒有繞射引起的穿透率突降；對 MacNeille 立方體以 s、p 偏振分別量穿透與反射對入射角的曲線，核對 Brewster 條件的角度寬度；對菱體以多波長 Sénarmont 量延遲量，驗證消色差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure wire-grid pitch, line width and height by scanning electron microscopy and record TM transmission and TE reflection spectra with a spectrophotometer and polarizer, confirming no diffraction-induced transmission drop at the short-wavelength end; for a MacNeille cube measure s and p transmission and reflection against incidence angle to check the angular width of the Brewster condition; measure the rhomb's retardance at several wavelengths by the Sénarmont method to verify achromaticity. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a415-v12-16","title":"線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鋁奈米線柵、MacNeille 膜堆與 Fresnel 菱體」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Aluminium nanowire grid, MacNeille stack and Fresnel rhomb” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"把為 BK7 設計的 MacNeille 膜堆鍍在 n = 1.75 的玻璃上，Brewster 條件不再成立，p 偏振在每個界面都有反射，消光比從 10³ 掉到 30；線柵週期做到 200 nm，藍光端出現繞射級，穿透率在 450 nm 以下崩落。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A MacNeille stack designed for BK7 deposited on n = 1.75 glass no longer meets the Brewster condition, p polarization reflects at every interface and extinction falls from 10³ to 30; a wire grid made at 200 nm pitch diffracts at the blue end and transmission collapses below 450 nm. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：Fresnel 菱體用兩次全反射各產生約 45° 的相位差，延遲量只依賴折射率，幾乎不隨波長變化，是消色差的四分之一波延遲器。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A Fresnel rhomb produces about 45° of phase difference at each of two total internal reflections; the retardance depends only on refractive index and hardly on wavelength, giving an achromatic quarter-wave retarder.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把為 BK7 設計的 MacNeille 膜堆鍍在 n = 1.75 的玻璃上，Brewster 條件不再成立，p 偏振在每個界面都有反射，消光比從 10³ 掉到 30；線柵週期做到 200 nm，藍光端出現繞射級，穿透率在 450 nm 以下崩落。","textEn":"A MacNeille stack designed for BK7 deposited on n = 1.75 glass no longer meets the Brewster condition, p polarization reflects at every interface and extinction falls from 10³ to 30; a wire grid made at 200 nm pitch diffracts at the blue end and transmission collapses below 450 nm.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「線柵、薄膜偏振分光器與菱體延遲器」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wire grids, thin-film polarizing splitters and rhomb retarders\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","把為 BK7 設計的 MacNeille 膜堆鍍在 n = 1.75 的玻璃上，Brewster 條件不再成立，p 偏振在每個界面都有反射，消光比從 10³ 掉到 30。","延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A MacNeille stack designed for BK7 deposited on n = 1.75 glass no longer meets the Brewster condition, p polarization reflects at every interface and extinction falls from 10³ to 30.","A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把為 BK7 設計的 MacNeille 膜堆鍍在 n = 1.75 的玻璃上，Brewster 條件不再成立，p 偏振在每個界面都有反射，消光比從 10³ 掉到 30；線柵週期做到 200 nm，藍光端出現繞射級，穿透率在 450 nm 以下崩落。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A MacNeille stack designed for BK7 deposited on n = 1.75 glass no longer meets the Brewster condition, p polarization reflects at every interface and extinction falls from 10³ to 30; a wire grid made at 200 nm pitch diffracts at the blue end and transmission collapses below 450 nm. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a415-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測」與「波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction\" and \"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a415-v12-17","title":"延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「Sénarmont 補償器與六個數量級的偵測」如何決定偏振光學元件製作的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Sénarmont compensator and six-decade detection” determines the key performance of “Polarization-optics fabrication”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"延遲量以 Sénarmont 法量測：待測片放在 45° 的線偏振光中，其後接一片精確的四分之一波片把橢圓偏振轉回線偏振，旋轉檢偏器到消光，檢偏器轉角的兩倍就是延遲量，量測精度由旋轉台的角度讀數與消光點的判定決定；更高精度與速度用光彈調制器或旋轉補償器的偏振儀。快軸方向以同樣的消光法標定，並刻在元件邊緣。消光比量測的瓶頸不是光學而是動態範圍：10⁶:1 需要偵測器在六個數量級內線性，實務上以鎖相放大、已校正的中性密度濾片分段量測，並把雜散光底限單獨量出扣除。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「Sénarmont 補償器與六個數量級的偵測」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Retardance is measured by the Sénarmont method: the sample sits in linearly polarized light at 45°, an accurate quarter-wave plate behind it converts the elliptical output back to linear, the analyser is rotated to extinction, and twice the analyser angle is the retardance, with accuracy set by the stage's angular readout and the extinction judgement; higher accuracy and speed come from photoelastic-modulator or rotating-compensator polarimeters. The fast-axis direction is marked by the same extinction method and engraved on the edge. The bottleneck in extinction measurement is not optics but dynamic range: 10⁶:1 needs a detector linear over six decades, so in practice lock-in detection and calibrated neutral-density filters are used in stages, with the stray-light floor measured separately and subtracted. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Sénarmont compensator and six-decade detection”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Sénarmont：檢偏器角度讀數不確定度 0.05° 給延遲量不確定度 0.1°，即 λ/3600；若四分之一波片本身偏 λ/300（1.2°），延遲量誤差以一階近似也約 λ/300，所以補償片的品質決定量測上限。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Sénarmont: an analyser angular uncertainty of 0.05° gives a retardance uncertainty of 0.1°, i.e. λ/3600; if the quarter-wave compensator itself is off by λ/300 (1.2°), the retardance error is also about λ/300 to first order, so the compensator's quality caps the measurement.","failure":"常見誤解：「延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「Sénarmont 補償器與六個數量級的偵測」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Sénarmont compensator and six-decade detection”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-17-k1","title":"延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測","titleEn":"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction","text":"延遲量以 Sénarmont 法量測：待測片放在 45° 的線偏振光中，其後接一片精確的四分之一波片把橢圓偏振轉回線偏振，旋轉檢偏器到消光，檢偏器轉角的兩倍就是延遲量，量測精度由旋轉台的角度讀數與消光點的判定決定；更高精度與速度用光彈調制器或旋轉補償器的偏振儀。快軸方向以同樣的消光法標定，並刻在元件邊緣。","textEn":"Retardance is measured by the Sénarmont method: the sample sits in linearly polarized light at 45°, an accurate quarter-wave plate behind it converts the elliptical output back to linear, the analyser is rotated to extinction, and twice the analyser angle is the retardance, with accuracy set by the stage's angular readout and the extinction judgement; higher accuracy and speed come from photoelastic-modulator or rotating-compensator polarimeters. The fast-axis direction is marked by the same extinction method and engraved on the edge.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction\" is correct?","options":["延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。","波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。","延遲量以 Sénarmont 法量測：待測片放在 45° 的線偏振光中，其後接一片精確的四分之一波片把橢圓偏振轉回線偏振，旋轉檢偏器到消光，檢偏器轉角的兩倍就是延遲量，量測精度由旋轉台的角度讀數與消光點的判定決定。"],"optionsEn":["A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate.","A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions.","Retardance is measured by the Sénarmont method: the sample sits in linearly polarized light at 45°, an accurate quarter-wave plate behind it converts the elliptical output back to linear, the analyser is rotated to extinction, and twice the analyser angle is the retardance, with accuracy set by the stage's angular readout and the extinction judgement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"延遲量以 Sénarmont 法量測：待測片放在 45° 的線偏振光中，其後接一片精確的四分之一波片把橢圓偏振轉回線偏振，旋轉檢偏器到消光，檢偏器轉角的兩倍就是延遲量，量測精度由旋轉台的角度讀數與消光點的判定決定；更高精度與速度用光彈調制器或旋轉補償器的偏振儀。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Retardance is measured by the Sénarmont method: the sample sits in linearly polarized light at 45°, an accurate quarter-wave plate behind it converts the elliptical output back to linear, the analyser is rotated to extinction, and twice the analyser angle is the retardance, with accuracy set by the stage's angular readout and the extinction judgement; higher accuracy and speed come from photoelastic-modulator or rotating-compensator polarimeters. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a415-v12-18","title":"延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測：定量估算","titleEn":"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「Sénarmont 補償器與六個數量級的偵測」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Sénarmont compensator and six-decade detection” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Sénarmont：檢偏器角度讀數不確定度 0.05° 給延遲量不確定度 0.1°，即 λ/3600；若四分之一波片本身偏 λ/300（1.2°），延遲量誤差以一階近似也約 λ/300，所以補償片的品質決定量測上限。消光比：偵測器雜訊等效功率 1 pW、輸入 10 mW，可分辨的漏光 10⁻¹⁰，但雜散光若佔 10⁻⁶ 就把上限壓在 10⁶:1。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Sénarmont: an analyser angular uncertainty of 0.05° gives a retardance uncertainty of 0.1°, i.e. λ/3600; if the quarter-wave compensator itself is off by λ/300 (1.2°), the retardance error is also about λ/300 to first order, so the compensator's quality caps the measurement. Extinction: a detector noise-equivalent power of 1 pW with 10 mW input resolves leakage of 10⁻¹⁰, but a stray-light floor of 10⁻⁶ limits the measurable ratio to 10⁶:1. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以已校正的參考波片（延遲量不確定度 λ/1000）檢查 Sénarmont 系統的讀值偏差；旋轉待測片 180° 再量一次，兩次差值的一半是軸向標定誤差；在消光比量測中拿掉待測件量系統本身的漏光底限，並以中性密度濾片驗證偵測器線性。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check the Sénarmont system's bias against a calibrated reference plate with λ/1000 retardance uncertainty; rotate the sample by 180° and re-measure, half the difference being the axis-marking error; in extinction measurement remove the sample to measure the system's own leakage floor and verify detector linearity with neutral-density filters.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Sénarmont：檢偏器角度讀數不確定度 0.05° 給延遲量不確定度 0.1°，即 λ/3600；若四分之一波片本身偏 λ/300（1.2°），延遲量誤差以一階近似也約 λ/300，所以補償片的品質決定量測上限。消光比：偵測器雜訊等效功率 1 pW、輸入 10 mW，可分辨的漏光 10⁻¹⁰，但雜散光若佔 10⁻⁶ 就把上限壓在 10⁶:1。","textEn":"Sénarmont: an analyser angular uncertainty of 0.05° gives a retardance uncertainty of 0.1°, i.e. λ/3600; if the quarter-wave compensator itself is off by λ/300 (1.2°), the retardance error is also about λ/300 to first order, so the compensator's quality caps the measurement. Extinction: a detector noise-equivalent power of 1 pW with 10 mW input resolves leakage of 10⁻¹⁰, but a stray-light floor of 10⁻⁶ limits the measurable ratio to 10⁶:1.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction\", which statement holds?","options":["Sénarmont：檢偏器角度讀數不確定度 0.05° 給延遲量不確定度 0.1°，即 λ/3600。","偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。","只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Sénarmont: an analyser angular uncertainty of 0.05° gives a retardance uncertainty of 0.1°, i.e. λ/3600.","A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation.","If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same."],"answer":0,"explanation":"Sénarmont：檢偏器角度讀數不確定度 0.05° 給延遲量不確定度 0.1°，即 λ/3600；若四分之一波片本身偏 λ/300（1.2°），延遲量誤差以一階近似也約 λ/300，所以補償片的品質決定量測上限。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Sénarmont: an analyser angular uncertainty of 0.05° gives a retardance uncertainty of 0.1°, i.e. λ/3600; if the quarter-wave compensator itself is off by λ/300 (1.2°), the retardance error is also about λ/300 to first order, so the compensator's quality caps the measurement. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a415-v12-19","title":"延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「Sénarmont 補償器與六個數量級的偵測」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Sénarmont compensator and six-decade detection” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以已校正的參考波片（延遲量不確定度 λ/1000）檢查 Sénarmont 系統的讀值偏差；旋轉待測片 180° 再量一次，兩次差值的一半是軸向標定誤差；在消光比量測中拿掉待測件量系統本身的漏光底限，並以中性密度濾片驗證偵測器線性。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check the Sénarmont system's bias against a calibrated reference plate with λ/1000 retardance uncertainty; rotate the sample by 180° and re-measure, half the difference being the axis-marking error; in extinction measurement remove the sample to measure the system's own leakage floor and verify detector linearity with neutral-density filters. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：用品質 λ/50 的四分之一波片當 Sénarmont 補償片，所有待測片的延遲量都帶著同一個系統偏差，整批交貨後在客戶端被判超差；消光比量測未擋雜散光，10⁶:1 的稜鏡只能量到 10⁴:1。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Using a λ/50 quarter-wave plate as the Sénarmont compensator stamps the same systematic bias on every measured plate and the whole delivery is rejected by the customer; extinction measured without stray-light control reads a 10⁶:1 prism as only 10⁴:1.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以已校正的參考波片（延遲量不確定度 λ/1000）檢查 Sénarmont 系統的讀值偏差；旋轉待測片 180° 再量一次，兩次差值的一半是軸向標定誤差；在消光比量測中拿掉待測件量系統本身的漏光底限，並以中性密度濾片驗證偵測器線性。","textEn":"Check the Sénarmont system's bias against a calibrated reference plate with λ/1000 retardance uncertainty; rotate the sample by 180° and re-measure, half the difference being the axis-marking error; in extinction measurement remove the sample to measure the system's own leakage floor and verify detector linearity with neutral-density filters.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","以已校正的參考波片（延遲量不確定度 λ/1000）檢查 Sénarmont 系統的讀值偏差。","波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Check the Sénarmont system's bias against a calibrated reference plate with λ/1000 retardance uncertainty.","A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以已校正的參考波片（延遲量不確定度 λ/1000）檢查 Sénarmont 系統的讀值偏差；旋轉待測片 180° 再量一次，兩次差值的一半是軸向標定誤差；在消光比量測中拿掉待測件量系統本身的漏光底限，並以中性密度濾片驗證偵測器線性。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check the Sénarmont system's bias against a calibrated reference plate with λ/1000 retardance uncertainty; rotate the sample by 180° and re-measure, half the difference being the axis-marking error; in extinction measurement remove the sample to measure the system's own leakage floor and verify detector linearity with neutral-density filters. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a415-v12-20","title":"延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「Sénarmont 補償器與六個數量級的偵測」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Sénarmont compensator and six-decade detection” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"用品質 λ/50 的四分之一波片當 Sénarmont 補償片，所有待測片的延遲量都帶著同一個系統偏差，整批交貨後在客戶端被判超差；消光比量測未擋雜散光，10⁶:1 的稜鏡只能量到 10⁴:1。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Using a λ/50 quarter-wave plate as the Sénarmont compensator stamps the same systematic bias on every measured plate and the whole delivery is rejected by the customer; extinction measured without stray-light control reads a 10⁶:1 prism as only 10⁴:1. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：消光比量測的瓶頸不是光學而是動態範圍：10⁶:1 需要偵測器在六個數量級內線性，實務上以鎖相放大、已校正的中性密度濾片分段量測，並把雜散光底限單獨量出扣除。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The bottleneck in extinction measurement is not optics but dynamic range: 10⁶:1 needs a detector linear over six decades, so in practice lock-in detection and calibrated neutral-density filters are used in stages, with the stray-light floor measured separately and subtracted.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"用品質 λ/50 的四分之一波片當 Sénarmont 補償片，所有待測片的延遲量都帶著同一個系統偏差，整批交貨後在客戶端被判超差；消光比量測未擋雜散光，10⁶:1 的稜鏡只能量到 10⁴:1。","textEn":"Using a λ/50 quarter-wave plate as the Sénarmont compensator stamps the same systematic bias on every measured plate and the whole delivery is rejected by the customer; extinction measured without stray-light control reads a 10⁶:1 prism as only 10⁴:1.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「延遲量、軸向與消光比的量測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Measuring retardance, axis orientation and extinction\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。","用品質 λ/50 的四分之一波片當 Sénarmont 補償片，所有待測片的延遲量都帶著同一個系統偏差，整批交貨後在客戶端被判超差。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions.","Using a λ/50 quarter-wave plate as the Sénarmont compensator stamps the same systematic bias on every measured plate and the whole delivery is rejected by the customer."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用品質 λ/50 的四分之一波片當 Sénarmont 補償片，所有待測片的延遲量都帶著同一個系統偏差，整批交貨後在客戶端被判超差；消光比量測未擋雜散光，10⁶:1 的稜鏡只能量到 10⁴:1。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using a λ/50 quarter-wave plate as the Sénarmont compensator stamps the same systematic bias on every measured plate and the whole delivery is rejected by the customer; extinction measured without stray-light control reads a 10⁶:1 prism as only 10⁴:1. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a415-v12-21","title":"波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「延遲量誤差預算表」如何決定偏振光學元件製作的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Retardance error-budget table” determines the key performance of “Polarization-optics fabrication”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"波片的延遲量誤差來自五個獨立來源：製造厚度誤差、工作波長偏離設計、溫度、入射角與安裝應力。入射角的影響與傾斜方向有關：繞慢軸傾斜使延遲量減少，繞快軸傾斜使延遲量增加，量級約為 sin²θ/(2n²) 的相對變化，且隨級數放大。把每一項換算成波數後以均方根相加，與規格比較，就能判斷該用零級、複合零級還是消色差設計，以及公差該往哪一項收緊。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「延遲量誤差預算表」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Retardance error in a waveplate comes from five independent sources: manufacturing thickness error, working wavelength away from design, temperature, incidence angle and mounting stress. The angular effect depends on tilt direction: tilting about the slow axis reduces retardance, tilting about the fast axis increases it, with a relative change of order sin²θ/(2n²), amplified by the order. Converting each term to waves and adding root-sum-square against the specification shows whether a zero-order, compound zero-order or achromatic design is needed and which tolerance to tighten. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Retardance error-budget table”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：入射角：θ = 5°、n ≈ 1.55 時相對變化 ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³，零級四分之一波片變化 4×10⁻⁴ 波（λ/2500），10 級則 0.016 波（λ/62）。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Incidence angle: at θ = 5° with n ≈ 1.55 the relative change ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³, a zero-order quarter-wave plate shifting by 4×10⁻⁴ waves (λ/2500) and a 10th-order plate by 0.016 waves (λ/62).","failure":"常見誤解：「波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「延遲量誤差預算表」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Retardance error-budget table”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-21-k1","title":"波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算","titleEn":"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget","text":"波片的延遲量誤差來自五個獨立來源：製造厚度誤差、工作波長偏離設計、溫度、入射角與安裝應力。入射角的影響與傾斜方向有關：繞慢軸傾斜使延遲量減少，繞快軸傾斜使延遲量增加，量級約為 sin²θ/(2n²) 的相對變化，且隨級數放大。","textEn":"Retardance error in a waveplate comes from five independent sources: manufacturing thickness error, working wavelength away from design, temperature, incidence angle and mounting stress. The angular effect depends on tilt direction: tilting about the slow axis reduces retardance, tilting about the fast axis increases it, with a relative change of order sin²θ/(2n²), amplified by the order.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget\" is correct?","options":["波片的延遲量誤差來自五個獨立來源：製造厚度誤差、工作波長偏離設計、溫度、入射角與安裝應力。","波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。","玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。"],"optionsEn":["Retardance error in a waveplate comes from five independent sources: manufacturing thickness error, working wavelength away from design, temperature, incidence angle and mounting stress.","A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions.","Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"波片的延遲量誤差來自五個獨立來源：製造厚度誤差、工作波長偏離設計、溫度、入射角與安裝應力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Retardance error in a waveplate comes from five independent sources: manufacturing thickness error, working wavelength away from design, temperature, incidence angle and mounting stress. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a415-v12-22","title":"波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「延遲量誤差預算表」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Retardance error-budget table” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：入射角：θ = 5°、n ≈ 1.55 時相對變化 ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³，零級四分之一波片變化 4×10⁻⁴ 波（λ/2500），10 級則 0.016 波（λ/62）。零級波片預算（633 nm）：厚度 λ/300 = 3.3×10⁻³ 波、波長 ±0.5 nm → 2×10⁻⁴、溫度 ±5 K → 1.2×10⁻⁴、入射角 ±2° → 6×10⁻⁵、安裝應力 λ/1000 = 1×10⁻³，RSS ≈ √(3.3² + 0.2² + 0.12² + 0.06² + 1²)×10⁻³ ≈ 3.5×10⁻³ 波 ≈ λ/290。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Incidence angle: at θ = 5° with n ≈ 1.55 the relative change ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³, a zero-order quarter-wave plate shifting by 4×10⁻⁴ waves (λ/2500) and a 10th-order plate by 0.016 waves (λ/62). Zero-order plate budget at 633 nm: thickness λ/300 = 3.3×10⁻³ waves, wavelength ±0.5 nm → 2×10⁻⁴, temperature ±5 K → 1.2×10⁻⁴, incidence ±2° → 6×10⁻⁵, mounting stress λ/1000 = 1×10⁻³, RSS ≈ √(3.3² + 0.2² + 0.12² + 0.06² + 1²)×10⁻³ ≈ 3.5×10⁻³ waves ≈ λ/290. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把波片裝在雙軸旋轉台上，分別繞快軸與慢軸傾斜 ±5° 量延遲量，確認符號相反且量級與 sin²θ/(2n²) 估計一致；用實測的厚度、溫度與角度分佈重算 RSS，與量到的批內延遲量分佈比較，若實測更寬就逐項追查。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Mount the plate on a two-axis stage and tilt ±5° about the fast and slow axes in turn, confirming opposite signs and magnitudes matching the sin²θ/(2n²) estimate; recompute the RSS from measured thickness, temperature and angle distributions and compare with the measured batch spread of retardance, tracing term by term if the real spread is wider.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"入射角：θ = 5°、n ≈ 1.55 時相對變化 ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³，零級四分之一波片變化 4×10⁻⁴ 波（λ/2500），10 級則 0.016 波（λ/62）。零級波片預算（633 nm）：厚度 λ/300 = 3.3×10⁻³ 波、波長 ±0.5 nm → 2×10⁻⁴、溫度 ±5 K → 1.2×10⁻⁴、入射角 ±2° → 6×10⁻⁵、安裝應力 λ/1000 = 1×10⁻³，RSS ≈ √(3.3² + 0.2² + 0.12² + 0.06² + 1²)×10⁻³ ≈ 3.5×10⁻³ 波 ≈ λ/290。","textEn":"Incidence angle: at θ = 5° with n ≈ 1.55 the relative change ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³, a zero-order quarter-wave plate shifting by 4×10⁻⁴ waves (λ/2500) and a 10th-order plate by 0.016 waves (λ/62). Zero-order plate budget at 633 nm: thickness λ/300 = 3.3×10⁻³ waves, wavelength ±0.5 nm → 2×10⁻⁴, temperature ±5 K → 1.2×10⁻⁴, incidence ±2° → 6×10⁻⁵, mounting stress λ/1000 = 1×10⁻³, RSS ≈ √(3.3² + 0.2² + 0.12² + 0.06² + 1²)×10⁻³ ≈ 3.5×10⁻³ waves ≈ λ/290.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget\", which statement holds?","options":["消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。","入射角：θ = 5°、n ≈ 1.55 時相對變化 ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³，零級四分之一波片變化 4×10⁻⁴ 波（λ/2500），10 級則 0.016 波（λ/62）。","波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。"],"optionsEn":["Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality.","Incidence angle: at θ = 5° with n ≈ 1.55 the relative change ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³, a zero-order quarter-wave plate shifting by 4×10⁻⁴ waves (λ/2500) and a 10th-order plate by 0.016 waves (λ/62).","A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter."],"answer":1,"explanation":"入射角：θ = 5°、n ≈ 1.55 時相對變化 ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³，零級四分之一波片變化 4×10⁻⁴ 波（λ/2500），10 級則 0.016 波（λ/62）。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Incidence angle: at θ = 5° with n ≈ 1.55 the relative change ≈ 0.0076/4.8 ≈ 1.6×10⁻³, a zero-order quarter-wave plate shifting by 4×10⁻⁴ waves (λ/2500) and a 10th-order plate by 0.016 waves (λ/62). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a415-v12-23","title":"波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「延遲量誤差預算表」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Retardance error-budget table” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把波片裝在雙軸旋轉台上，分別繞快軸與慢軸傾斜 ±5° 量延遲量，確認符號相反且量級與 sin²θ/(2n²) 估計一致；用實測的厚度、溫度與角度分佈重算 RSS，與量到的批內延遲量分佈比較，若實測更寬就逐項追查。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Mount the plate on a two-axis stage and tilt ±5° about the fast and slow axes in turn, confirming opposite signs and magnitudes matching the sin²θ/(2n²) estimate; recompute the RSS from measured thickness, temperature and angle distributions and compare with the measured batch spread of retardance, tracing term by term if the real spread is wider. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：在 f/2 的會聚光束裡使用 10 級波片，光束邊緣光線傾斜 14°，延遲量在口徑內變化超過 λ/10，輸出偏振態隨位置不同，偏振成像對比大幅下降。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A 10th-order plate used in an f/2 converging beam sees edge rays tilted 14°, retardance varies by more than λ/10 across the aperture, the output polarization changes with position and polarization-imaging contrast collapses.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把波片裝在雙軸旋轉台上，分別繞快軸與慢軸傾斜 ±5° 量延遲量，確認符號相反且量級與 sin²θ/(2n²) 估計一致；用實測的厚度、溫度與角度分佈重算 RSS，與量到的批內延遲量分佈比較，若實測更寬就逐項追查。","textEn":"Mount the plate on a two-axis stage and tilt ±5° about the fast and slow axes in turn, confirming opposite signs and magnitudes matching the sin²θ/(2n²) estimate; recompute the RSS from measured thickness, temperature and angle distributions and compare with the measured batch spread of retardance, tracing term by term if the real spread is wider.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。","把波片裝在雙軸旋轉台上，分別繞快軸與慢軸傾斜 ±5° 量延遲量，確認符號相反且量級與 sin²θ/(2n²) 估計一致。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter.","Mount the plate on a two-axis stage and tilt ±5° about the fast and slow axes in turn, confirming opposite signs and magnitudes matching the sin²θ/(2n²) estimate."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把波片裝在雙軸旋轉台上，分別繞快軸與慢軸傾斜 ±5° 量延遲量，確認符號相反且量級與 sin²θ/(2n²) 估計一致；用實測的厚度、溫度與角度分佈重算 RSS，與量到的批內延遲量分佈比較，若實測更寬就逐項追查。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Mount the plate on a two-axis stage and tilt ±5° about the fast and slow axes in turn, confirming opposite signs and magnitudes matching the sin²θ/(2n²) estimate; recompute the RSS from measured thickness, temperature and angle distributions and compare with the measured batch spread of retardance, tracing term by term if the real spread is wider. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a415-v12-24","title":"波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「延遲量誤差預算表」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Retardance error-budget table” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"在 f/2 的會聚光束裡使用 10 級波片，光束邊緣光線傾斜 14°，延遲量在口徑內變化超過 λ/10，輸出偏振態隨位置不同，偏振成像對比大幅下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A 10th-order plate used in an f/2 converging beam sees edge rays tilted 14°, retardance varies by more than λ/10 across the aperture, the output polarization changes with position and polarization-imaging contrast collapses. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：把每一項換算成波數後以均方根相加，與規格比較，就能判斷該用零級、複合零級還是消色差設計，以及公差該往哪一項收緊。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Converting each term to waves and adding root-sum-square against the specification shows whether a zero-order, compound zero-order or achromatic design is needed and which tolerance to tighten.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"在 f/2 的會聚光束裡使用 10 級波片，光束邊緣光線傾斜 14°，延遲量在口徑內變化超過 λ/10，輸出偏振態隨位置不同，偏振成像對比大幅下降。","textEn":"A 10th-order plate used in an f/2 converging beam sees edge rays tilted 14°, retardance varies by more than λ/10 across the aperture, the output polarization changes with position and polarization-imaging contrast collapses.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「波長、溫度、入射角與公差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wavelength, temperature, incidence angle and tolerance budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["在 f/2 的會聚光束裡使用 10 級波片，光束邊緣光線傾斜 14°，延遲量在口徑內變化超過 λ/10，輸出偏振態隨位置不同，偏振成像對比大幅下降。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。"],"optionsEn":["A 10th-order plate used in an f/2 converging beam sees edge rays tilted 14°, retardance varies by more than λ/10 across the aperture, the output polarization changes with position and polarization-imaging contrast collapses.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在 f/2 的會聚光束裡使用 10 級波片，光束邊緣光線傾斜 14°，延遲量在口徑內變化超過 λ/10，輸出偏振態隨位置不同，偏振成像對比大幅下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A 10th-order plate used in an f/2 converging beam sees edge rays tilted 14°, retardance varies by more than λ/10 across the aperture, the output polarization changes with position and polarization-imaging contrast collapses. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a415-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合」與「規格換算、隔離度預算與交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration\" and \"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a415-v12-25","title":"應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「無應力安裝座與膠合界面」如何決定偏振光學元件製作的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Stress-free mount and cemented interface” determines the key performance of “Polarization-optics fabrication”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"任何偏振元件在安裝時受到的機械應力都會透過光彈效應產生附加雙折射，使偏振片的消光比下降、波片的延遲量偏移，而且分佈不均勻。玻璃與熔融石英的應力光學係數約 3 到 4×10⁻¹² /Pa，看似很小，但光程只要幾毫米、應力只要 1 MPa 就能造成數十奈米的延遲。因此元件用三點或撓性無應力座固定，避免彈簧壓片與過緊的螺紋環；膠合界面要選低收縮的光學膠並控制固化，雷射功率高時改用空氣間隙或光學接觸。增透膜必須針對晶體的兩個折射率設計，並把快軸刻記與安裝基準對齊。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「無應力安裝座與膠合界面」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Any mechanical stress applied to a polarization element during mounting adds birefringence through the photoelastic effect, lowering a polarizer's extinction and shifting a waveplate's retardance, non-uniformly across the aperture. The stress-optic coefficient of glass and fused silica is only about 3 to 4×10⁻¹² /Pa, yet a path of a few millimetres under 1 MPa produces tens of nanometres of retardance. Elements are therefore held in three-point or flexure stress-free mounts rather than spring retainers or over-tightened threaded rings; cemented interfaces use low-shrinkage optical cement with controlled curing, and air spacing or optical contact replaces cement at high laser power. Antireflection films must be designed for the crystal's two indices, and the fast-axis mark aligned to the mounting datum. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Stress-free mount and cemented interface”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：應力雙折射 Δn = C·σ：C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa、σ = 1 MPa 時 Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶，光程 L = 5 mm 的延遲 = Δn·L = 17.5 nm，在 633 nm 為 0.028 波 ≈ λ/36，比製造公差 λ/300 大八倍。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Stress birefringence Δn = C·σ: with C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa and σ = 1 MPa, Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶, and over a path L = 5 mm the retardance = Δn·L = 17.5 nm, 0.028 waves ≈ λ/36 at 633 nm, eight times the λ/300 manufacturing tolerance.","failure":"常見誤解：「玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「無應力安裝座與膠合界面」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Stress-free mount and cemented interface”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-25-k1","title":"應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合","titleEn":"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration","text":"任何偏振元件在安裝時受到的機械應力都會透過光彈效應產生附加雙折射，使偏振片的消光比下降、波片的延遲量偏移，而且分佈不均勻。玻璃與熔融石英的應力光學係數約 3 到 4×10⁻¹² /Pa，看似很小，但光程只要幾毫米、應力只要 1 MPa 就能造成數十奈米的延遲。","textEn":"Any mechanical stress applied to a polarization element during mounting adds birefringence through the photoelastic effect, lowering a polarizer's extinction and shifting a waveplate's retardance, non-uniformly across the aperture. The stress-optic coefficient of glass and fused silica is only about 3 to 4×10⁻¹² /Pa, yet a path of a few millimetres under 1 MPa produces tens of nanometres of retardance.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration\" is correct?","options":["玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。","任何偏振元件在安裝時受到的機械應力都會透過光彈效應產生附加雙折射，使偏振片的消光比下降、波片的延遲量偏移，而且分佈不均勻。","偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。"],"optionsEn":["Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence.","Any mechanical stress applied to a polarization element during mounting adds birefringence through the photoelastic effect, lowering a polarizer's extinction and shifting a waveplate's retardance, non-uniformly across the aperture.","A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"任何偏振元件在安裝時受到的機械應力都會透過光彈效應產生附加雙折射，使偏振片的消光比下降、波片的延遲量偏移，而且分佈不均勻。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Any mechanical stress applied to a polarization element during mounting adds birefringence through the photoelastic effect, lowering a polarizer's extinction and shifting a waveplate's retardance, non-uniformly across the aperture. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a415-v12-26","title":"應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合：定量估算","titleEn":"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「無應力安裝座與膠合界面」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Stress-free mount and cemented interface” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：應力雙折射 Δn = C·σ：C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa、σ = 1 MPa 時 Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶，光程 L = 5 mm 的延遲 = Δn·L = 17.5 nm，在 633 nm 為 0.028 波 ≈ λ/36，比製造公差 λ/300 大八倍。要把安裝貢獻壓到 λ/1000（0.63 nm），應力必須低於 1 MPa × 0.63/17.5 ≈ 36 kPa，相當於 10 mm 直徑元件上不到 3 N 的均勻夾持力。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Stress birefringence Δn = C·σ: with C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa and σ = 1 MPa, Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶, and over a path L = 5 mm the retardance = Δn·L = 17.5 nm, 0.028 waves ≈ λ/36 at 633 nm, eight times the λ/300 manufacturing tolerance. Holding the mounting contribution to λ/1000 (0.63 nm) requires stress below 1 MPa × 0.63/17.5 ≈ 36 kPa, under 3 N of uniform clamping force on a 10 mm diameter element. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：安裝前後各做一次全口徑延遲量成像（偏光顯微鏡或成像偏振儀），相減得到安裝引入的延遲圖與其方向，逐步放鬆固定力直到殘留小於 λ/1000；膠合件固化後放置一週再量一次，確認收縮應力已穩定。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Image full-aperture retardance before and after mounting with a polarizing microscope or imaging polarimeter, subtract to obtain the mounting-induced retardance map and its orientation, and loosen the holding force until the residual is below λ/1000; re-measure cemented parts a week after curing to confirm shrinkage stress has stabilised.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"應力雙折射 Δn = C·σ：C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa、σ = 1 MPa 時 Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶，光程 L = 5 mm 的延遲 = Δn·L = 17.5 nm，在 633 nm 為 0.028 波 ≈ λ/36，比製造公差 λ/300 大八倍。要把安裝貢獻壓到 λ/1000（0.63 nm），應力必須低於 1 MPa × 0.63/17.5 ≈ 36 kPa，相當於 10 mm 直徑元件上不到 3 N 的均勻夾持力。","textEn":"Stress birefringence Δn = C·σ: with C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa and σ = 1 MPa, Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶, and over a path L = 5 mm the retardance = Δn·L = 17.5 nm, 0.028 waves ≈ λ/36 at 633 nm, eight times the λ/300 manufacturing tolerance. Holding the mounting contribution to λ/1000 (0.63 nm) requires stress below 1 MPa × 0.63/17.5 ≈ 36 kPa, under 3 N of uniform clamping force on a 10 mm diameter element.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration\", which statement holds?","options":["只要延遲量在設計波長正確，多級與零級波片的表現就一樣。","任何高折射率／低折射率膜堆鍍在任何玻璃上都能當偏振分光器。","應力雙折射 Δn = C·σ：C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa、σ = 1 MPa 時 Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶，光程 L = 5 mm 的延遲 = Δn·L = 17.5 nm，在 633 nm 為 0.028 波 ≈ λ/36，比製造公差 λ/300 大八倍。"],"optionsEn":["If retardance is right at the design wavelength, multi-order and zero-order plates behave the same.","Any high/low-index stack on any glass works as a polarizing beam splitter.","Stress birefringence Δn = C·σ: with C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa and σ = 1 MPa, Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶, and over a path L = 5 mm the retardance = Δn·L = 17.5 nm, 0.028 waves ≈ λ/36 at 633 nm, eight times the λ/300 manufacturing tolerance."],"answer":2,"explanation":"應力雙折射 Δn = C·σ：C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa、σ = 1 MPa 時 Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶，光程 L = 5 mm 的延遲 = Δn·L = 17.5 nm，在 633 nm 為 0.028 波 ≈ λ/36，比製造公差 λ/300 大八倍。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Stress birefringence Δn = C·σ: with C = 3.5×10⁻¹² /Pa and σ = 1 MPa, Δn = 3.5×10⁻⁶, and over a path L = 5 mm the retardance = Δn·L = 17.5 nm, 0.028 waves ≈ λ/36 at 633 nm, eight times the λ/300 manufacturing tolerance. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a415-v12-27","title":"應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「無應力安裝座與膠合界面」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Stress-free mount and cemented interface” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"安裝前後各做一次全口徑延遲量成像（偏光顯微鏡或成像偏振儀），相減得到安裝引入的延遲圖與其方向，逐步放鬆固定力直到殘留小於 λ/1000；膠合件固化後放置一週再量一次，確認收縮應力已穩定。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Image full-aperture retardance before and after mounting with a polarizing microscope or imaging polarimeter, subtract to obtain the mounting-induced retardance map and its orientation, and loosen the holding force until the residual is below λ/1000; re-measure cemented parts a week after curing to confirm shrinkage stress has stabilised. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：Glan 稜鏡以螺紋環鎖緊，應力雙折射讓消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10³ 且隨溫度變化；UV 膠固化不均使複合零級波片中央與邊緣延遲量差 λ/50，偏振態在口徑內不一致。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A Glan prism locked by a threaded ring loses extinction from 10⁵ to 10³ through stress birefringence that also drifts with temperature; unevenly cured UV cement leaves a λ/50 retardance difference between centre and edge of a compound zero-order plate, so polarization varies across the aperture.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"安裝前後各做一次全口徑延遲量成像（偏光顯微鏡或成像偏振儀），相減得到安裝引入的延遲圖與其方向，逐步放鬆固定力直到殘留小於 λ/1000；膠合件固化後放置一週再量一次，確認收縮應力已穩定。","textEn":"Image full-aperture retardance before and after mounting with a polarizing microscope or imaging polarimeter, subtract to obtain the mounting-induced retardance map and its orientation, and loosen the holding force until the residual is below λ/1000; re-measure cemented parts a week after curing to confirm shrinkage stress has stabilised.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration\"?","options":["安裝前後各做一次全口徑延遲量成像（偏光顯微鏡或成像偏振儀），相減得到安裝引入的延遲圖與其方向，逐步放鬆固定力直到殘留小於 λ/1000。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。"],"optionsEn":["Image full-aperture retardance before and after mounting with a polarizing microscope or imaging polarimeter, subtract to obtain the mounting-induced retardance map and its orientation, and loosen the holding force until the residual is below λ/1000.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate."],"answer":0,"explanation":"安裝前後各做一次全口徑延遲量成像（偏光顯微鏡或成像偏振儀），相減得到安裝引入的延遲圖與其方向，逐步放鬆固定力直到殘留小於 λ/1000；膠合件固化後放置一週再量一次，確認收縮應力已穩定。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Image full-aperture retardance before and after mounting with a polarizing microscope or imaging polarimeter, subtract to obtain the mounting-induced retardance map and its orientation, and loosen the holding force until the residual is below λ/1000; re-measure cemented parts a week after curing to confirm shrinkage stress has stabilised. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a415-v12-28","title":"應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「無應力安裝座與膠合界面」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Stress-free mount and cemented interface” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"Glan 稜鏡以螺紋環鎖緊，應力雙折射讓消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10³ 且隨溫度變化；UV 膠固化不均使複合零級波片中央與邊緣延遲量差 λ/50，偏振態在口徑內不一致。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A Glan prism locked by a threaded ring loses extinction from 10⁵ to 10³ through stress birefringence that also drifts with temperature; unevenly cured UV cement leaves a λ/50 retardance difference between centre and edge of a compound zero-order plate, so polarization varies across the aperture. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：增透膜必須針對晶體的兩個折射率設計，並把快軸刻記與安裝基準對齊。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Antireflection films must be designed for the crystal's two indices, and the fast-axis mark aligned to the mounting datum.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「玻璃是各向同性的，安裝時怎麼夾都不會產生雙折射。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Glass is isotropic, so clamping it any way produces no birefringence.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"Glan 稜鏡以螺紋環鎖緊，應力雙折射讓消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10³ 且隨溫度變化；UV 膠固化不均使複合零級波片中央與邊緣延遲量差 λ/50，偏振態在口徑內不一致。","textEn":"A Glan prism locked by a threaded ring loses extinction from 10⁵ to 10³ through stress birefringence that also drifts with temperature; unevenly cured UV cement leaves a λ/50 retardance difference between centre and edge of a compound zero-order plate, so polarization varies across the aperture.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「應力雙折射、膠合與安裝整合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Stress birefringence, cementing and mounting integration\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","Glan 稜鏡以螺紋環鎖緊，應力雙折射讓消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10³ 且隨溫度變化。","偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","A Glan prism locked by a threaded ring loses extinction from 10⁵ to 10³ through stress birefringence that also drifts with temperature.","A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Glan 稜鏡以螺紋環鎖緊，應力雙折射讓消光比從 10⁵ 掉到 10³ 且隨溫度變化；UV 膠固化不均使複合零級波片中央與邊緣延遲量差 λ/50，偏振態在口徑內不一致。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A Glan prism locked by a threaded ring loses extinction from 10⁵ to 10³ through stress birefringence that also drifts with temperature; unevenly cured UV cement leaves a λ/50 retardance difference between centre and edge of a compound zero-order plate, so polarization varies across the aperture. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a415-v12-29","title":"規格換算、隔離度預算與交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「偏振元件規格表與隔離度預算」如何決定偏振光學元件製作的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Polarization-component specification sheet and isolation budget” determines the key performance of “Polarization-optics fabrication”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"偏振元件的規格表應列出：延遲量與公差（指定波長與溫度）、快軸標記精度、消光比（指定波長、入射角、光束發散）、穿透波前、表面品質、增透膜殘餘反射、損傷門檻、工作溫度範圍與安裝方式限制。系統端把這些數值換算成系統指標，例如 Faraday 隔離器的隔離度由偏振片消光比與 45° 旋轉角誤差共同決定，兩項漏光相加後取分貝。交接資料包含晶體批次與定向紀錄、延遲量與軸向量測報告、消光比曲線與量測條件，讓系統整合者能重現驗收結果。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「偏振元件規格表與隔離度預算」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A polarization-component specification should list retardance and tolerance (at stated wavelength and temperature), fast-axis marking accuracy, extinction ratio (at stated wavelength, incidence angle and beam divergence), transmitted wavefront, surface quality, antireflection residual, damage threshold, operating temperature range and mounting limits. The system side converts these into system metrics; for instance a Faraday isolator's isolation is set jointly by polarizer extinction and the error in the 45° rotation angle, the two leakages adding before conversion to decibels. The handoff carries the crystal batch and orientation record, retardance and axis measurement reports and the extinction curve with its conditions, so the integrator can reproduce the acceptance result. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Polarization-component specification sheet and isolation budget”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：隔離度 ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Isolation ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ).","failure":"常見誤解：「偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「偏振元件規格表與隔離度預算」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Polarization-component specification sheet and isolation budget”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-29-k1","title":"規格換算、隔離度預算與交接","titleEn":"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff","text":"偏振元件的規格表應列出：延遲量與公差（指定波長與溫度）、快軸標記精度、消光比（指定波長、入射角、光束發散）、穿透波前、表面品質、增透膜殘餘反射、損傷門檻、工作溫度範圍與安裝方式限制。系統端把這些數值換算成系統指標，例如 Faraday 隔離器的隔離度由偏振片消光比與 45° 旋轉角誤差共同決定，兩項漏光相加後取分貝。","textEn":"A polarization-component specification should list retardance and tolerance (at stated wavelength and temperature), fast-axis marking accuracy, extinction ratio (at stated wavelength, incidence angle and beam divergence), transmitted wavefront, surface quality, antireflection residual, damage threshold, operating temperature range and mounting limits. The system side converts these into system metrics; for instance a Faraday isolator's isolation is set jointly by polarizer extinction and the error in the 45° rotation angle, the two leakages adding before conversion to decibels.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「規格換算、隔離度預算與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff\" is correct?","options":["偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。","消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。","偏振元件的規格表應列出：延遲量與公差（指定波長與溫度）、快軸標記精度、消光比（指定波長、入射角、光束發散）、穿透波前、表面品質、增透膜殘餘反射、損傷門檻、工作溫度範圍與安裝方式限制。"],"optionsEn":["A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation.","Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality.","A polarization-component specification should list retardance and tolerance (at stated wavelength and temperature), fast-axis marking accuracy, extinction ratio (at stated wavelength, incidence angle and beam divergence), transmitted wavefront, surface quality, antireflection residual, damage threshold, operating temperature range and mounting limits."],"answer":2,"explanation":"偏振元件的規格表應列出：延遲量與公差（指定波長與溫度）、快軸標記精度、消光比（指定波長、入射角、光束發散）、穿透波前、表面品質、增透膜殘餘反射、損傷門檻、工作溫度範圍與安裝方式限制。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A polarization-component specification should list retardance and tolerance (at stated wavelength and temperature), fast-axis marking accuracy, extinction ratio (at stated wavelength, incidence angle and beam divergence), transmitted wavefront, surface quality, antireflection residual, damage threshold, operating temperature range and mounting limits. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a415-v12-30","title":"規格換算、隔離度預算與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「偏振元件規格表與隔離度預算」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Polarization-component specification sheet and isolation budget” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：隔離度 ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ)。ER = 10⁴、旋轉角誤差 Δφ = 0.5°：漏光 10⁻⁴ + 7.6×10⁻⁵ = 1.76×10⁻⁴ → 37.5 dB，不達 40 dB；ER = 10⁵、Δφ = 0.5°：8.6×10⁻⁵ → 40.6 dB 勉強合格；ER = 10⁵、Δφ = 0.3°：3.7×10⁻⁵ → 44.3 dB，留有餘裕。所以 40 dB 的隔離器需要 10⁵:1 的偏振片與 0.3° 的旋轉角控制。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Isolation ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ). With ER = 10⁴ and a rotation error Δφ = 0.5°: leakage 10⁻⁴ + 7.6×10⁻⁵ = 1.76×10⁻⁴ → 37.5 dB, short of 40 dB; ER = 10⁵ and Δφ = 0.5°: 8.6×10⁻⁵ → 40.6 dB, marginal; ER = 10⁵ and Δφ = 0.3°: 3.7×10⁻⁵ → 44.3 dB with margin. A 40 dB isolator therefore needs 10⁵:1 polarizers and 0.3° rotation control. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：組裝後直接量隔離度（反向注入功率與穿透功率之比），與偏振片消光比和旋轉角誤差的預算相比較，差異超過 2 dB 時回頭檢查應力與對準；核對規格表每一項都有對應的量測紀錄與條件（波長、溫度、角度），並以第二套偏振儀抽樣複測延遲量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: After assembly measure isolation directly as the ratio of reverse-injected to transmitted power and compare with the budget from polarizer extinction and rotation error; a discrepancy above 2 dB sends you back to stress and alignment.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"隔離度 ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ)。ER = 10⁴、旋轉角誤差 Δφ = 0.5°：漏光 10⁻⁴ + 7.6×10⁻⁵ = 1.76×10⁻⁴ → 37.5 dB，不達 40 dB；ER = 10⁵、Δφ = 0.5°：8.6×10⁻⁵ → 40.6 dB 勉強合格；ER = 10⁵、Δφ = 0.3°：3.7×10⁻⁵ → 44.3 dB，留有餘裕。所以 40 dB 的隔離器需要 10⁵:1 的偏振片與 0.3° 的旋轉角控制。","textEn":"Isolation ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ). With ER = 10⁴ and a rotation error Δφ = 0.5°: leakage 10⁻⁴ + 7.6×10⁻⁵ = 1.76×10⁻⁴ → 37.5 dB, short of 40 dB; ER = 10⁵ and Δφ = 0.5°: 8.6×10⁻⁵ → 40.6 dB, marginal; ER = 10⁵ and Δφ = 0.3°: 3.7×10⁻⁵ → 44.3 dB with margin. A 40 dB isolator therefore needs 10⁵:1 polarizers and 0.3° rotation control.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「規格換算、隔離度預算與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["隔離度 ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ)。","波片做到正確厚度就行了，光軸方向差一點沒關係。","延遲量量測只需要一個偏振片和一個功率計就夠精確。"],"optionsEn":["Isolation ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ).","A waveplate only needs the right thickness; a slightly off optic axis does not matter.","A retardance measurement needs only one polarizer and a power meter to be accurate."],"answer":0,"explanation":"隔離度 ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Isolation ≈ −10·log₁₀(1/ER + sin²Δφ). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a415-v12-31","title":"規格換算、隔離度預算與交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「偏振元件規格表與隔離度預算」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Polarization-component specification sheet and isolation budget” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"組裝後直接量隔離度（反向注入功率與穿透功率之比），與偏振片消光比和旋轉角誤差的預算相比較，差異超過 2 dB 時回頭檢查應力與對準；核對規格表每一項都有對應的量測紀錄與條件（波長、溫度、角度），並以第二套偏振儀抽樣複測延遲量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"After assembly measure isolation directly as the ratio of reverse-injected to transmitted power and compare with the budget from polarizer extinction and rotation error; a discrepancy above 2 dB sends you back to stress and alignment. Check that every specification line has a matching measurement record with conditions (wavelength, temperature, angle), and re-measure sampled retardances on a second polarimeter. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：規格只寫「四分之一波片，633 nm」而沒有公差、級數與溫度範圍，供應商交付 10 級波片，在 40 °C 的機櫃內延遲量偏 λ/60，隔離器隔離度掉到 30 dB，雙方對「合格」各執一詞。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A specification reading only quarter-wave plate, 633 nm without tolerance, order or temperature range is met with a 10th-order plate; inside a 40 °C enclosure its retardance drifts by λ/60, isolation drops to 30 dB and both sides dispute what passed.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"組裝後直接量隔離度（反向注入功率與穿透功率之比），與偏振片消光比和旋轉角誤差的預算相比較，差異超過 2 dB 時回頭檢查應力與對準；核對規格表每一項都有對應的量測紀錄與條件（波長、溫度、角度），並以第二套偏振儀抽樣複測延遲量。","textEn":"After assembly measure isolation directly as the ratio of reverse-injected to transmitted power and compare with the budget from polarizer extinction and rotation error; a discrepancy above 2 dB sends you back to stress and alignment. Check that every specification line has a matching measurement record with conditions (wavelength, temperature, angle), and re-measure sampled retardances on a second polarimeter.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「規格換算、隔離度預算與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","組裝後直接量隔離度（反向注入功率與穿透功率之比），與偏振片消光比和旋轉角誤差的預算相比較，差異超過 2 dB 時回頭檢查應力與對準。","波片的延遲量只與厚度有關，使用條件不會改變它。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","After assembly measure isolation directly as the ratio of reverse-injected to transmitted power and compare with the budget from polarizer extinction and rotation error.","A waveplate's retardance depends only on thickness and is unchanged by operating conditions."],"answer":1,"explanation":"組裝後直接量隔離度（反向注入功率與穿透功率之比），與偏振片消光比和旋轉角誤差的預算相比較，差異超過 2 dB 時回頭檢查應力與對準；核對規格表每一項都有對應的量測紀錄與條件（波長、溫度、角度），並以第二套偏振儀抽樣複測延遲量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"After assembly measure isolation directly as the ratio of reverse-injected to transmitted power and compare with the budget from polarizer extinction and rotation error; a discrepancy above 2 dB sends you back to stress and alignment. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a415-v12-32","title":"規格換算、隔離度預算與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"prerequisiteIds":["a415-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「偏振元件規格表與隔離度預算」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Polarization-component specification sheet and isolation budget” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"規格只寫「四分之一波片，633 nm」而沒有公差、級數與溫度範圍，供應商交付 10 級波片，在 40 °C 的機櫃內延遲量偏 λ/60，隔離器隔離度掉到 30 dB，雙方對「合格」各執一詞。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A specification reading only quarter-wave plate, 633 nm without tolerance, order or temperature range is met with a 10th-order plate; inside a 40 °C enclosure its retardance drifts by λ/60, isolation drops to 30 dB and both sides dispute what passed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接資料包含晶體批次與定向紀錄、延遲量與軸向量測報告、消光比曲線與量測條件，讓系統整合者能重現驗收結果。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff carries the crystal batch and orientation record, retardance and axis measurement reports and the extinction curve with its conditions, so the integrator can reproduce the acceptance result.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「偏振元件只要在設計波長標稱正確，就能直接換算成系統的隔離度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A polarization component nominally correct at its design wavelength translates directly into system isolation.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a415-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"規格只寫「四分之一波片，633 nm」而沒有公差、級數與溫度範圍，供應商交付 10 級波片，在 40 °C 的機櫃內延遲量偏 λ/60，隔離器隔離度掉到 30 dB，雙方對「合格」各執一詞。","textEn":"A specification reading only quarter-wave plate, 633 nm without tolerance, order or temperature range is met with a 10th-order plate; inside a 40 °C enclosure its retardance drifts by λ/60, isolation drops to 30 dB and both sides dispute what passed.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]},{"id":"a415-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「規格換算、隔離度預算與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Specification conversion, isolation budget and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","消光比是偏振片的固定常數，與波長、角度和光束品質無關。","規格只寫「四分之一波片，633 nm」而沒有公差、級數與溫度範圍，供應商交付 10 級波片，在 40 °C 的機櫃內延遲量偏 λ/60，隔離器隔離度掉到 30 dB，雙方對「合格」各執一詞。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Extinction ratio is a fixed constant of the polarizer independent of wavelength, angle and beam quality.","A specification reading only quarter-wave plate, 633 nm without tolerance, order or temperature range is met with a 10th-order plate."],"answer":2,"explanation":"規格只寫「四分之一波片，633 nm」而沒有公差、級數與溫度範圍，供應商交付 10 級波片，在 40 °C 的機櫃內延遲量偏 λ/60，隔離器隔離度掉到 30 dB，雙方對「合格」各執一詞。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A specification reading only quarter-wave plate, 633 nm without tolerance, order or temperature range is met with a 10th-order plate; inside a 40 °C enclosure its retardance drifts by λ/60, isolation drops to 30 dB and both sides dispute what passed. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-edmund-understanding-waveplates","v12o-ucsb-mat288-polarization-lecture","v12o-thorlabs-polarization-optics"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
